id:641acaa302fe9a5308510539 :cause id:64093b542eed5dcadba50897;
                            :organisationDescription "In our Research Lab, behavioural research ideas are tested in person, online or in the field. Since its foundation more than 17,000 volunteers have participated in over 850 studies to create positive social change.  ";
                            :organisationName "London Business School Research Lab";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://lbs.sona-systems.com/>.
id:641accae9f6c9513b07735a4 :activityDescription """Participate in cutting edge, academic research. Just 5 mins walk from Baker Street Station, London. You could be asked to ride a static bike, consume a food or drink item or simply share your thoughts on a topic. 

We have a study running at present you may be eligible for!

How does it work? 
1. Create a free account: https://lbs.sona-systems.com
2. Complete 5 quick questions
3. Take part in online or Lab studies at our Lab 
 
https://www.london.edu/faculty-and-research/research-support-for-faculty/research-lab/for-participants

Call +44(0)207 000 8630 
Email: lab@london.edu
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641acaa302fe9a5308510539;
                            :activityTitle "London Business School Research Lab - Earn £10 taking part in behavioural research".
id:641accae9f6c9513b07735a5 :address "Research Lab - London Business School, Park Road, London";
