                            :organisationWebsite <https://cumbriacvs.org.uk/volunteering/information-for-volunteers/>.
id:641c6e047ea34dd5493a9098 :activityDescription """Are you interested in helping provide skills for life to the young people of Leigh and surrounding areas?  Where you don’t have to dedicate every last second you have? Where you can meet new people, make new friends and learn new things? 

If so, 7th Tonbridge Scouts, Leigh needs you! 

You can become a section leader, assistant section leader, or even a section assistant with all different levels of responsibility and commitment, with the ability to experience all those things and more.  Along with plenty of other roles, even some that don’t include working with the young people directly, if that’s not for you! 

Get in touch today to find a role that is suitable to you! 

Email: William.Richardson@tonbridge-scouts.org.uk 
Or visit our website: www.7thtonbridgescouts.org.uk

Located in Leigh, behind the Fleur De Lis - Leigh, on Kiln Lane.  

Yours In Scouting,
The 7th Tonbridge Leadership Team""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641b7b1ba6b21f5f6dcf6f4a;
                            :activityTitle "Become A Volenteer".
