                            :organisationDescription """We provide a full welfare benefits support service and give help and advice on how to complete PIP/ESA/Carers/Attendance allowance forms and we offer support at benefit tribunals

In addition we have formed CLASAG Cumbria and Lancashire Asbestos support group where we provide support for patients and carers of people suffering with mesothelioma asbestos related illnesses in the form of support groups. We meet monthly at Barrow and Preston    """;
