                            :organisationDescription """Our volunteer-led charity provides multi-sensory shows, pantomimes and immersive experiences for children with disabilities and their families.  Our professional actors are trained in Makaton signing and perform in and around the audience providing 1:1 sensory experiences to every child.
We also offer Work Experience Programmes and  workshops for young people transitioning from special schools.
We operate a drop-in centre for the community and a Dementia Cafe.""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/5ece9e9b-be35-4551-8416-6d75c39d2013_2024-04-12T08:43:35.592Z.png>;
