id:6421c2adc67ef6399dd1a111 :activityDescription """Our small charity needs more volunteers working from home selling donated clothes on our online websites.
One volunteer currently raises £2,500 per annum using just a few hours a week of her time.  Can you please do the same?
You will need to have access to a home computer and own a mobile phone with camera.
Online selling is very straightforward:
- Photograph an item
- Describe that item with measurements
Donations are good quality and clean and it is a lot of fun to see something sold that you posted online.  Buyers are keen to help raise funds and there is fun dialogue between them and the charity seller.
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6421c0ace950ac8ae43dd1a1;
                            :activityTitle "Raising funds for children with disabilities".
id:6422c7256ee3c7a8e76059eb :cause id:64093b552eed5dcadba508a3;
                            :organisationDescription """The Living Rainforest Centre is run by the Trust for Sustainable Living.

We welcome around 100,000 visitors each year, including 25,000 children on school trips. Visitors can experience the sights, sounds and smells of a lush tropical rainforest environment – and explore how plants, animals, human needs, economies and cultures are all linked.

The centre is home to over 850 species of plants and animals, including rare and endangered species of global conservation value.""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/26cb9313-c4af-415f-afd4-cf6e208f8cbd_2023-03-28T10:53:24.699Z.png>;
                            :organisationName "The Living Rainforest";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://livingrainforest.org/about-us>.
id:6422cb6f971946582e42ebb1 :activityDescription """The centre is home to over 850 species of plants and animals, including rare and endangered species of global conservation value. 

We need weekly volunteers to support with the care of our animals, including feeding and cleaning out their enclosures. """;
                            :activityOrganisation id:6422c7256ee3c7a8e76059eb;
                            :activityTitle "Weekly volunteer with our Animals!".
id:64232da230af56b4590e0d51 :cause id:64093b542eed5dcadba50897,
