                            :organisationDescription """Citizens Advice is an operating name of the National Association of Citizens Advice Bureaux. Registered charity number 279057
VAT number 726 0202 76 Company limited by guarantee. Registered number 01436945 England
Registered office: Citizens Advice, 3rd Floor, 1 Easton Street, London, WC1X 0DW""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/12208740_1209985835686279_4761963015365923357_n.png>;
