                            :organisationDescription """Rushcliffe CVS was set up in 1984 to support and develop community and voluntary activity in the Borough of Rushcliffe. 
 
We are:\\t 
�\\tA Registered Charity number 1079880 
�\\tA Company Limited by Guarantee number 3867757 
�\\tNon-profit making 
�\\tNon-statutory, i.e. independent of local or central government 
 
We are one of over 270 similar organisations across the country.  Each is an independent organisation working for the benefit of its local community.  
 
We exist to: 
�\\tGive support and services to voluntary and community organisations 
�\\tIdentify needs in the community and take action to develop a response 
�\\tEncourage groups to work together and work in partnership with local authorities 
""";
                            :organisationName "Rushcliffe CVS";
