id:6425d9f3a0624f3ab9fc3409 :cause id:64093b542eed5dcadba50897;
                            :organisationDescription """Circles South East is an award-winning charity which works to reduce the impact and instances of sexual harm through prevention, rehabilitation, education and safeguarding.  Volunteers are at the core of what we do and operate across all aspects of our work. 

We work with survivors and others impacted by sexual violence to help them heal and with perpetrators to help them avoid reoffending.""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/download_JBUW8rGXMGiYjQcFibgpyi.jpg>;
