                            :organisationDescription """Blind Veterans UK helps ex-Service men and women of every generation rebuild their lives after sight loss. Since 1915 we�ve provided rehabilitation, training, practical advice and emotional support to tens of thousands of blind veterans.

Our mission is to ensure all blind veterans should have access to the finest quality of services to help them discover life beyond sight loss.""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/logo2_J7fmiwNXuVLNxaCMHR4vtT.125x125_eBNJaRbgrHgg24Ry8rhuu3.jpg>;
