                            :organisationDescription """We are a volunteer-run, not-for-profit social enterprise which provides the DalesBus network of weekend public bus services into and around the Yorkshire Dales National Park and Nidderdale National Landscape and promotes public transport in the area. 

We are owned by Friends of the Dales, a registered charity.""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/dalesbus_logo_sept15_sq.gif>;
