                            :organisationWebsite <https://youtu.be/EwszKOJ1-sI>.
id:6425fb2ef2d4b77a6e161cf4 :cause id:64093b542eed5dcadba50897,
                                   id:64093b552eed5dcadba5089f,
                                   id:64093b552eed5dcadba508a1;
                            :organisationDescription """Empathy for special children is a registered charity, working across Shropshire, providing the support and opportunity for those growing up with a Hidden Difference, aged 0 - 18; predominately Autism, and those of all ages that care for them, to not only be successful but also find some fun, friendship and a place to belong in a lonely world. Our core projects provide the foundation for these children and young people to break down the everyday barriers in life that others either do not see or do not understand. 
The wide programme of activities provided under the ENJOY project present the opportunity everyone to access the support most appropriate to them. Be that to CONNECT and get OUT and ABOUT with other families or as individuals without family support; for young people with a difference to UNLEASH their potential or as SIBS to get SOCIAL with others that understand. At every session our support package ENABLE ensures that a team of trained young people is available to give everyone the support and confidence they need to eb successful, included and a valued in our little special community.
For us this family wide approach ensure that everyone around a child or young person not gets the support they need but also that no child or young person ever feels they are a problem, something that needs intervention and compartmentalisation. They, their lives and therefore their families are different, not wrong. 
10 years on we are proud to still be user lead""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/073c7422-c19c-48bf-9e80-60e07fe5cde6_2025-08-19T15:06:06.250Z.jpeg>;
                            :organisationName "Empathy for special children";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://www.empathyforspecialchildren.org/>.
