                                   id:64093b552eed5dcadba508a3;
                            :organisationDescription """London Parks & Gardens is a small charity with a big mission to champion London’s historic parks, gardens, squares and green spaces for the benefit of everyone.

The charity relies mainly on volunteers to carry out its important work, whether carrying out research, responding to planning applications that will encroach on much loved green space or working with others to celebrate London’s amazing hidden squares and gardens.""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/82d9951a-cda6-4d3e-b8ad-3b3eccbc4d43_2024-10-14T10:53:23.321Z.jpeg>;
