                            :organisationDescription "Green Allotments is a new charity. We are creating new, not-for-profit, private allotment sites for local communities at an affordable rent. Our sites will be cultivated via sustainable gardening practices for the benefit of the environment. We are a Charity and we do not make any profit from creating allotment sites. ";
