id:642ab18d5411f8a5bd22e484 :activityDescription """As a partnership we are looking for people who want the opportunity to help out within their community.
There are many different roles on offer and it is possible to choose only one or to be involved in various activities.
We are looking specifically for :-
VOLUNTEER DRIVERS
BEFRIENDERS
 and also those who may be interested in
a spot of gardening, supported walking, playing board games with residents in a social care setting, sports buddies and many more!
If you have a particular skill or interest you want to offer your time with please get in touch.
""";
