id:642ae184604189579797a503 :cause id:64093b552eed5dcadba508a3;
                            :organisationDescription "We are the UK’s leading wetland conservation charity. We’re working to create a world where healthy wetland nature thrives and enriches lives. We are a community of dedicated staff, volunteers and members, brought together by a love of wetlands and a drive to protect them. Drawing on over 75 years of experience in wetland conservation to find answers to today's challenges across the UK and internationally. We manage 10 important wetland sites across the UK, where volunteers are a crucial part of our story. ";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/a11094f0-9c69-433e-bb5d-dc312ef47ffe_2023-04-03T14:24:04.399Z.jpeg>;
