                            :organisationDescription "Catching Lives is an independent charity aimed at supporting the rough sleepers, homeless and vulnerably housed in Canterbury and East Kent; those who have, for many reasons, fallen through the gaps in society and feel they have nowhere else to turn.";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/b294a57c-e6da-4df7-a95e-587aeb647a56_2023-04-04T11:57:16.554Z.jpeg>;
