id:642ee29e0a25edd5be9f46c0 :cause id:64093b542eed5dcadba50897,
                                   id:64093b552eed5dcadba508a3;
                            :organisationDescription """We believe that green spaces are an essential part of healthy, happy communities.

Join thousands of people and communities across the UK connecting to nature on their doorsteps and contributing to its protection.

There are hundreds of ways for you to join in with TCV. Get fit, help look after green spaces, meet people, learn new skills and have fun - all at the same time!

""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/d1b01759-30f3-4bf7-b3b9-109f56f5052e_2023-04-06T15:17:50.357Z.png>;
                            :organisationName "The Conservation Volunteers";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://www.tcv.org.uk/>.
id:64311a13c107842e37cbe053 :cause id:64093b552eed5dcadba508a3;
                            :organisationDescription """The volunteer-run, award-winning Nidderdale Museum brings the rich heritage of its dale to life with exhibits, photos and video delightfully presented in themed spaces and dioramas. 
Housed in an imposing Victorian Workhouse, history is brought to life through sight and sound, making imaginative use of the 30,000 strong collection. Sit in the old school house or pub snug, walk down the mine tunnel or follow the Children's trail.

""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/491b66c7-4068-4b27-a682-6517c042c794_2023-04-08T07:38:57.111Z.png>;
                            :organisationName "Nidderdale Museum";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://www.nidderdalemuseum.com/>.
id:643121ef482fb928d86f400e :activityDescription """The museum has a collection of over 30,000 items. Get up close to them and help out in the vital jobs of archiving and cataloguing to ensure that the collection is well managed and that, over time, we are able to curate, exhibit, and share them in the best possible ways.
No experience needed; just come and join in with the friendly team of volunteers who give some time to doing this important work.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64311a13c107842e37cbe053;
                            :activityTitle "Museum Collection Archiving and Cataloguing".
id:64312379482fb928d86f405b :activityDescription """Volunteering for Scouting is easier than you think. 

Whether you volunteer every week or can spare an hour a month or a day a year, we have opportunities both behind the scenes and working with young people. With full support and training, you can experience the fun, friendship and adventure of Scouting for yourself, all on a flexible basis.

We are particularly looking for volunteers to be Beaver, Scout or Cub leaders or helpers and executive council members. 

Volunteer today and have a positive impact on the young people of Tetbury!""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425dede2702d4ba5b25e391;
                            :activityTitle "Beaver, Cub and Scout Leaders, Helpers and Executive Committee Members".
id:64312379482fb928d86f405c :address "Tetbury";
