                            :organisationDescription """Thanks to incredible supporters like you, we can provide life-changing support for the Armed Forces community.

The Royal British Legion is the country’s largest Armed Forces charity, with 180,000 members, 55,000 volunteers and a network of partners and charities; helping to make sure we can provide support wherever and whenever it’s needed.

Whether you’re a fundraiser, volunteer, member or proud Poppy Appeal collector – however you choose to support us, we couldn’t do it without you.""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/f3e15718-b82c-41b5-a7d5-489ef129daf7_2023-04-17T14:31:12.503Z.png>;
                            :organisationName "Royal British Legion";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://rbl.org.uk/poppyvolunteer>.
id:643e6f6c18293ea45b514dc7 :cause id:64093b552eed5dcadba508a1;
                            :organisationDescription "Give Blood 4 Good is on a mission to get as many people to give blood as possible. Through proper education and sharing stories about the importance of blood donation, we hope to encourage donation to be a regular part of people’s lives.";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/760a2b31-86e4-4955-865a-4350866544ec_2023-04-18T10:22:35.946Z.png>;
                            :organisationName "Give Blood 4 Good";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://www.giveblood4good.org/>.
id:643e6fbe18293ea45b514ec7 :activityDescription "Donating blood is a simple way to save and improve lives across the UK. Join us on our journey to increase the number of young adults who regularly donate blood by booking your appointment through the appropriate link. https://www.giveblood4good.org/donate";
                            :activityOrganisation id:643e6f6c18293ea45b514dc7;
                            :activityTitle "Pledge to donate blood".
id:643e7be1d1225c29a0e396e3 :cause id:64093b542eed5dcadba50897,
