                                   id:64093b552eed5dcadba508a3;
                            :organisationDescription """Hub volunteers have been involved in many projects so far and continue to be asked for their assistance from the CVSE sector across Calderdale. Volunteers help organisations that do not have enough volunteers themselves but need support for one off events or short term projects. 

Volunteers have completed varied roles such as stewarding at festivals, research for history exhibition and assisting with activity workshops for the Healthy Holidays Programme. 

We also have connections to respond to natural disasters such as floods and environmental organisations completing such tasks as planting trees and \"balsam bashing\". 

To Join the Volunteer Hub please go to www.vsialliance.org.uk and find the Volunteer Hub under the Volunteering tab or email volunteerhub@vsialliance.org.uk""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/3d015844-d0e2-4490-aaff-546e7772afde_2023-04-18T11:15:45.170Z.jpeg>;
                            :organisationName "VSI Alliance Volunteer Hub";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://www.vsialliance.org.uk/vsi-alliance-volunteer-hub>.
id:643fcff1ebec1f7ebaa630f9 :activityDescription "2-4 hour weekly shifts in one of our retail shops or Distribution Warehouse.  Various tasks to include receiving, sorting and pricing donations. Displays and general shop tidying. Serving customers and operating the till.";
