                            :activityTitle "Retail Assistant Woburn Sands".
id:643fd0940ea3094adcae7c2e :activityDescription """2-4  hour weekly shifts in one of our Retail shops or Distribution warehouse.
Various tasks including - taking in donations - sorting donations - price tagging - serving customers - operating the till - displays - tidying shop.""";
