id:643fe01e15df41f85dfc9972 :activityDescription """The Countryside Regeneration Trust (CRT) protects, promotes, and regenerates our land and all life on it. We have 19 farms across England and our goal is to develop and implement sustainable farming methods and vital conservation practices to help increase biodiversity across our farms and help protect the land and wildlife for the future.

We are looking for enthusiastic people to join our friendly teams of volunteers at our farms. There are lots of exciting initiatives and conservation projects we need your help with. No experience is needed and we provide you with training, tools and tea, coffee and biscuits!
Looking for a fun day out in the countryside with like-minded people? We’d love for you to join our team and help us regenerate the countryside.

For more information please go to our website https://www.thecrt.co.uk/ or you can register to volunteer here and we’ll get in touch with all the information https://www.thecrt.co.uk/volunteering

If you would like further information please email volunteering@thecrt.co.uk

We look forward to hearing from you.
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64240bb2ebcd2ed96987e0d2;
                            :activityTitle "Conservation Volunteer".
id:643fe01e15df41f85dfc9973 :address "Bere Marsh Farm, Shillingstone, Blandford";
