id:64428a026891fbe0fb35daf9 :activityDescription """We would love more volunteers to join our friendly dog loving team! 
Meet new people (and dogs!), boost your CV, confidence and skills all while knowing that you’re helping us care for thousands of dogs each year.

We have many shifts available but help on Wednesdays, Thursdays and Saturdays. would be particularly great! A couple of hours a week would be so helpful! Our retail volunteers can take part in a number of activities at the shop including sorting and prepping donations for the shop floor, merchandising and window display creation, using the till and chatting with customers and their dogs about the work of Dogs Trust. If you're interested please do apply or feel free to contact the shop or email charityshops@dogstrust.org.uk for more info. Thank you so much!""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6411d4f2c9f517b85449fd41;
