id:64458fd78e3f59f1087ff2c5 :activityDescription """Little Valley Shelter currently have 6 charity shops throughout Devon. Each one plays a huge role in raising the funds needed to care for the animals that arrive at our shelter.

The success of our charity shop is down to our amazing team of volunteers, and we always need more help. """;
