id:644ad1ff3145691845f8ae55 :activityDescription "Let's Talk About Loss provides peer support groups for young grievers aged 18 - 35. We're always looking for young grievers who want to give back and volunteer to run groups in their local town or city. You need to have been bereaved at least one year and have a good support network around you to support you in your own grief. We'll provide training, support and access to bereavement counsellors if you need them. We'd love to hear from you!";
