id:644e70e93d588446cd01d256 :cause id:64093b542eed5dcadba50897;
                            :organisationDescription """Hill Top & Caldwell Big Local (HTC) is a project that covers Old Hill Top, Chilvers Coton, New Hill Top & Caldwell.

Together these neighbourhoods were awarded £1 Million from the Big Lottery Fund to make a lasting positive difference to the area over 10 years.

The project is resident led, what we do is driven by what the people who live here tell us what their priorities are. 

We hold resident coffee mornings, litter picks, estate walk abouts, wildlife chats, scavenger hunts, stakeholder engagement events, and crafts for residents.""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/c61f5fa8-277d-45fd-9ede-64a74f14aca1_2023-04-30T13:45:12.542Z.png>;
                            :organisationName "Hill Top and Caldwell Big Local ";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://htcbiglocal.org.uk/>.
