id:644f1844809c8405dc48749f :activityDescription "Emmanuel Christian Centre help to co-ordinate the Community Meals Service in Ulverston and Swarthmoor. They are currently looking to recruit volunteers to help with our Community Meals on Wheels service.  They are looking for reliable people who can give a day a week or fortnight to help deliver our community meals to our clients who live in Ulverston and the Swarthmoor Area from around 11.30am for an hour and a half. You will be work in pairs so would not be on your own. Both volunteer helpers or drivers are needed to deliver hot cooked meals to older or vulnerable people in the local community.";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641c62477ea34dd5493a89b3;
                            :activityTitle "Community Meals on Wheels Service-Volunteer Helpers or Drivers".
id:644f1844809c8405dc4874a0 :address "Grasmere Rd, Ulverston LA12 9BY, UK";
                            :latitude "54.1908848"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "-3.0856815"^^xsd:double.
id:644f1870809c8405dc487bd4 :activityDescription "The Incredible Edible project offers opportunities to grow food; work with local community groups such as Residential Homes, Guides, schools and food growing projects; organise events such as shared lunches and workshops; liaise with local food producers and retailers and promote activities through liaison with the local press or facebook (check out Incredible Edible Ulverston on facebook). To find out how the movement started (there are now more than 125 groups in the UK) have a look at www.incredible-edible-todmorden.co.uk. We have already run training with the Royal Horticultural Society, had a film night, led a walk in Ulverston Walking Festival, hosted a shared soup lunch involving four community growing groups, set up a new community garden and got several projects ready to start from Easter 2017 but there are not enough of us to do everything. You can get involved in whatever aspect interests you –it is very flexible!";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641c62477ea34dd5493a89b3;
                            :activityTitle "Incredible Edible Volunteer".
id:644f1870809c8405dc487bd5 :address "Grasmere Rd, Ulverston LA12 9BY, UK";
                            :latitude "54.1908848"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "-3.0856815"^^xsd:double.
