                            :longitude "-1.4069793"^^xsd:double.
id:644f24125595048a3d682e17 :activityDescription """Volunteers needed for a new mission!

We are looking for people aged 14+ years, with some spare time this summer, to help us run the Summer Reading Challenge in our libraries.

The theme of the Summer Reading Challenge 2019 is Space Chase, an out-of-this-world adventure inspired by the 50th anniversary of the first moon landing.

Children taking part in the challenge will join our super space family, The Rockets, for a thrilling mission to track down books nabbed by mischievous aliens! The fun starts at your local library from Saturday 13 July.

To find out more about this volunteer role and complete the online application form visit www.westsussex.gov.uk/src""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425cf76a0624f3ab9fb3edd;
                            :activityTitle "Summer Reading Challenge Volunteer Henfield Library".
