id:644f2912494c8ad3e5fff207 :activityDescription """Are you able to help our clients get ready for employment? 

We’re looking for people who can offer our clients support with a wide range of work related skills:

• Amending CVs
• Interview practice & preparation
• Identifying transferable skills and building their confidence to find work
• Practical skills, such as basic IT, effective communication and being organised
• How to present yourself to an employer

We also need volunteers who can deliver coaching sessions to help clients improve their confidence, motivation and other areas that will help them find and sustain employment. You'll coach clients on a one-to-one basis, using your coaching training to help them towards a brighter future.

By offering this help, you will give our clients a chance to practise their job seeking skills and share your experience and knowledge from your own career.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425cd40a0624f3ab9fb07c7;
                            :activityTitle "Employment Support Coach  - Hounslow Greater London".
