id:644f2915494c8ad3e5fff32a :activityDescription """Could you run a small group session on Mindfulness for our clients, to help support their wellbeing and build their social network?

Shaw Trust's participants on the Work and Health Programme face a number of challenges finding and sustaining employment; these may include lack of confidence and self-esteem and not having a network of support. Through partaking in small group activities we hope to help them try something new, build their confidence and network and therefore improve their overall wellbeing.

We'd love to hear from you if you:
- Have some experience in and knowledge of Mindfulness
- Are able to deliver engaging small group sessions 
- Are willing to briefly evaluate the sessions""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425cd40a0624f3ab9fb07c7;
                            :activityTitle "Social Activity Group Lead - Mindfulness (Barnet)".
id:644f2915494c8ad3e5fff32b :address "West Drayton UB7 9NA, UK";
