id:644fb8343bb95d9ede5c06b3 :activityDescription """LOOKING FOR AN EXCITING AND INTERESTING WAY TO MAKE A DIFFERENCE TO YOUR COMMUNITY AND THE LIFE'S OF YOUNG PEOPLE?

DO YOU HAVE THE TIME, ENERGY AND COMMITMENT TO HELP A YOUNG PERSON REALISE THEIR POTENTIAL?

if so please explore volunteer opportunities with Circle South East, a charity working to reduce sexual harm through prevention, rehabilitation, education and safeguarding.

We support young people who have been identified as at risk, or who are already involved in the youth system displaying sexual harmful behaviour. We encourage our volunteers to nurture, support, encourage and reintegrate young people in their local communities, reducing social isolation and emotional loneliness and increasing the wellbeing of the young person.

We also invite expression of interest from qualified youth counsellors prepared to commit time to the project.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425d9f3a0624f3ab9fc3409;
                            :activityTitle "Circles - Youth Service Volunteer".
id:644fb8343bb95d9ede5c06b4 :address "Sale Garden Cottages, Wokingham RG40 2BY, UK";
