id:644fbd32449fb9795b2fb82b :activityDescription """Are you a former teacher, tutor or good at helping people understand basic numeracy and literacy? 

We have an exciting role at Yew Tree Resource Centre facilitating learning groups for vulnerable adults with disabilities.

If you could dedicate your time to help at the day centre in this area, then we are waiting to hear from you.""";
