id:644fbd51449fb9795b2fb895 :activityDescription """Aged 18 or over? Want to shape the future of young people?

Like the idea of inspiring and leading young people to achieve things they never thought possible? Looking for something exciting to do in your spare time?

Then why not become an Army Cadet Volunteer!

We are looking for volunteers to assist the Detachment Commander in Supporting an Army Cadet Force Unit in East Ham

Duties may include:

-Writing/distributing letters
- recording funds for camps and trips
- data entry onto Defence Westminster System
- Liaising with cadets
- liaising with parents 
- assisting with general duties""";
