id:644fbd54449fb9795b2fb9a7 :activityDescription """We invite volunteers to BHRUT to complement and enhance the care and support given by the hospital to improve a patient's experience. 

The aim of this role is front of house based and involves a great deal of interaction with patients and the general public.

The voluntary tasks for this role are:

To help on the information desk and offer a welcoming and professional service to our patients, visitors and staff and generally be a friendly face for all to see.

To make patient and visitors feel at ease by welcoming them, directing them or escorting them to their location.

To provide reassurance, information or advice on the local services available to patients and visitors.

Help maintain the appearance of the main foyer and report spillages and any health and safety issues.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641834de11ac4e5fee26ed1e;
                            :activityTitle "Welcome/Wayfinder (HVC - 1022)".
