id:644fbd54449fb9795b2fb9ba :activityDescription """If you love working around children and families, then this is the role for you!

We have an opening for someone to join our happy band of administration volunteers, covering our reception desk on a Monday morning from 8.30 – 12.30 

You will be responsible for welcoming our service users in to the building, answering the telephone and taking messages and signing in visitors along with a variety of administration tasks

It is an important role within First Step and we are looking for a cheerful, adaptable and professional person who enjoys working in a team""";
