id:644fbd55449fb9795b2fba0a :activityDescription """SSAFA is the oldest Tri Military Charity in the U.K. It serves to alleviate suffering to any serving or ex veteran within the North East London Area.

We are looking for a Digital Marketing Volunteer  to help run our Branch micro site and social Media, to help us advertise and maximise our message. 

Keeping content up to date, relevant and appropriate with the aim to increase traffic to our sites.""";
