id:644fbd5a449fb9795b2fbc3a :activityDescription """We are inviting volunteers to BHRUT to complement and enhance the care and support given by the hospital to improve a patient's experience.

The aim of this role is administration based and involves a great deal of discretion when handling patient notes and information relating to each department or patient.

Volunteers will be assisting with administration duties such as answering the telephone, taking messages, filing and data entry, assisting the team with mail outs, liaising with families and patients regarding appointments.""";
