id:644fbd79449fb9795b2fbca6 :activityDescription """Do you have a keen eye for detail?
Are you good at organising?
Do you have a few hours to spare? 

Our Romford Retail store desperately needs volunteers to get us organised!

Our retail shop plays a vital role in raising funds and awareness for our cause. 

As a shop volunteer you are among the most visible faces of the charity and contribute hugely to how the public perceive us and the work we do.

The purpose of the role is to assist in the day to day running of our charity shop to maximise sales and profitability.

This is a great opportunity to gain and develop your experience in the competitive retail sector and make new friends.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641834de11ac4e5fee26ed1e;
