id:644fbd7c449fb9795b2fbe3c :activityDescription """Are you caring and compassionate ? Could you give one to one support to our members with specific needs ?

The Blue T's are a friendly group of diverse individuals who volunteer and support our members, the Artistic Director and Choreographer in sessions and performances.  

They work together to ensure that members are able to fully participate in all areas of the performing arts in line with our inclusive ethos. 

Our members are aged between 7 - 17 along with an adult's group 18+

The group meets at RJ Mitchells Primary School between 5 - 7:30 pm on Monday evening, term time only""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641834de11ac4e5fee26ed1e;
                            :activityTitle "1:1 Blue T Support - RJ Mitchell Primary School - (HVC-791)".
