id:644fbea4449fb9795b2fc1c1 :activityDescription """Accurately minute meetings, in a format agreed between the job holder and the Chair, and circulate the draft minutes to committee members for their approval.
• Liaise with committee members to update Board regarding agreed action(s).

Additional/optional responsibilities:

• Ensure up-to-date records are kept of committee membership.
• Liaise with the Chair who will produce the meeting agendas.
• Circulate agendas and any supporting papers in good time.
• Receive agenda items from other committee members.
• Check that quorum is present.
• Ensure that the chair signs the minutes once they have been approved.
• Circulate agendas and minutes of the annual general meeting (AGM).

""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425d8d2a0624f3ab9fc184e;
                            :activityTitle "Minutes secretary ".
