The role is great fun and you will be working in a very supportive and inclusive team.

Our charity shops contribute significant funds to the Hospice to enable it to continue to support patients and their families across our catchment area. This volunteer role will assist in the day-to-day running of our Princess Alice Hospice shops, with the purpose of maximising sales and profitability.

