id:644fc365a3c53c19c9b74f85 :activityDescription """We are recruiting a Volunteer to prepare & support our fleet of five accessible vehicles for our MS Support centre at Northlands in Bromley, Kent. 
This is an active hands-on volunteer role.

You will be joining an existing and friendly team of volunteers running & supporting the services of Northlands.  We open on Tuesdays, Wednesdays and Thursdays.  
We also use the vehicles to collect members throughout Bromley Borough, and for day trips.  

The role involves vehicle preparation and checks to ensure our fleet is operational and available to collect people from their homes in the Bromley area on Tuesdays, Wednesdays and Thursdays.
No vehicle technical experience is necessary as training will be provided.  You would be responsible for Vehicle Presentation for our five accessible vehicles.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:642613a4de05bf8ae7ca1628;
                            :activityTitle "Vehicle Presentation and Support at Northlands in Bromley".
