                            :longitude "-0.2383246"^^xsd:double.
id:644fc4eea3c53c19c9b7516d :activityDescription """Do you enjoy working with museum artefacts? Would you enjoy the challenge of organising one of our collections? If you consider you could contribute your skills to the Handling Collection, we’d like to meet you. 

You will:
•	Carefully pack, store and label collection items
•	Colour code, categorise and label storage boxes, and suggest changes to collection content 
•	Catalogue collections data on a spreadsheet and write information cards
•	Identify needs for remedial conservation and cleaning
•	Carry out basic cleaning and polishing of selected items
•	Prepare administrative information and forms for external contractors and borrowers 
•	Meet clients and contractors""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425dc2aa0624f3ab9fc643f;
                            :activityTitle "Handling Collection Assistant".
