id:644fc4eea3c53c19c9b75193 :activityDescription """Ensure our visitors receive a warm welcome to the RAF Museum, be a key point of contact and support visitors to make the most of their experience with us.


Join the Visitor Experience team at our London or Cosford site as a front of house volunteer. If you are looking for an opportunity to engage with a wide range of people, in a unique and special environment, then this could be the role for you.""";
