id:644fc94ea3c53c19c9b761f8 :activityDescription """We are looking for a volunteer to support our Research Team to assist in research and analysis.

Main Tasks can include:

- Administering an FOI (Freedom of Information) request from a dedicated e-mail account
- Organising and analysing the data received from the FOI
- Proof-reading and stat checking
- Dealing with simple statistics and analysis requests from other teams in Shelter
- Helping us to organise our research library
- The chance to work with other teams in our communications division – parliamentary team, campaigns team, media team""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425cee0a0624f3ab9fb34d5;
