id:644fca1aa3c53c19c9b765a1 :activityDescription """Do you have a passion for healthy cooking/eating and have a Food Safety Certificate (Ideally Level 2)?  If so, please read on!

Talgarth Road Registered Care Home 

41-43 Talgarth Road is a registered care home that provides support and accommodation for up to 10 people with enduring mental health needs. 
Our aim and focus is to support our clients in integrating back into the larger community when they are ready to, live optimally with their mental illness and giving them the autonomy regarding their support.  We pride our self in what we do best and we value every individual in our service, working together to support them to achieve their life aspirations and goals by working with them to enhance their strength, encourage them to believe in themselves and also focus on both physical and mental well-being of the individual.
Talgarth Road provides day to day support to clients which may include personal care, physical, social and emotional support, developmental and leisure-based opportunities.

Location: West Kensington 
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425cec6a0624f3ab9fb3209;
                            :activityTitle "Cooking and Baking Volunteer - West Kensington".
