id:644fca21a3c53c19c9b7699d :activityDescription """Are you interested in helping people with Mental Health? 

Do you like walking and enjoy the great outdoors? 

Would you like to provide a chance to improve people’s mental and physical fitness, to have fun and socialize and to discover London?

If so we could do with your help!

About  The Grove Resource Centre 

The Grove Resource Centre is a specialist mental health day centre offering a wide range of groups that are tailored to the needs of our service users. They are designed to provide a choice of support options that will help their recovery to a full life in the community.

Join our mental health Day Centre. As a Walking Group Coordinator, you will be part of a team contributing to service users’ health and wellbeing, supporting them to improve their quality of life. You will plan with service users fun and stimulating walks in and around London, which will provide a chance to improve both their mental and physical fitness, to have fun and socialize and to discover London.

Location: Kensington and Chelsea""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425cec6a0624f3ab9fb3209;
                            :activityTitle "Walking Group Facilitator - Kensington and Chelsea".
id:644fca21a3c53c19c9b7699e :address "Kensington High St, London W8 5SA, UK";
