id:644fcc55a3c53c19c9b7726d :activityDescription """As a member of our team of befriending volunteers you could make a difference to someone by bringing the outside world in and brightening their day.

We aim to provide a carefully matched, volunteer befriender who can visit for an hour each week on a long-term basis.  Visits might involve chatting over a cuppa, playing a game, doing puzzles, sharing a mutual interest, or perhaps reading the newspaper.

Alternatively, you can assist us at our Day Club, or escort our clients on our minibus for daily transport and monthly trips.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425dc9da0624f3ab9fc7194;
                            :activityTitle "Volunteer Befrienders/Day Club Assistants/Minibus Escorts - Age UK Sheppey".
