id:644fcc5aa3c53c19c9b774a2 :activityDescription """Age UK offer advice and practical support to elderly clients living in the local community.

As a volunteer befriender we would seek to match you with someone nearby to visit for about an hour each week at their home.  You and your 'friend' might enjoy a chat and a cuppa or perhaps play a game, do puzzles, go for a local walk, swap stories, and hopefully enjoy some laughs.

Befrienders do not get involved in personal care, shopping, domestic tasks, administering medication, driving, financial/legal matters or offer formal advice.""";
