id:644fcceca3c53c19c9b7755f :activityDescription """Get into the festive spirit by volunteering at G4’s Christmas tour in Leeds Town Hall, The Headrow, Leeds LS1 3AD on Wednesday, 27th November. Hear wonderful renditions of Christmas classics, and join in on a few hymns yourself all while supporting the charity Missing People. This is a fantastic opportunity to volunteer at a truly enjoyable evening so don’t miss out.
You'll be acting as ushers, showing guests to their seats on arrival. You will also be helping with the bucket collection at the end of the night, by standing at the door holding a bucket as guests leave. You'll be expected to be at the event from 17:30 until 22:00. Further details will be sent you to on application.""";
