id:644fcdeea3c53c19c9b777e6 :activityDescription """The National Volunteer Team are recruiting for a volunteer to support with office based responsibilities. This is a really exciting time to join the team as Action for Children celebrates its 150th anniversary, and we are currently in the process of an Investing in Volunteers Assessment

The role can be discussed further as we would like to play to the individual's skills and interests so we can both achieve as much as possible from the opportunity. There is scope to be involved with administration, databases and social media. Typical activities could include; 

•Answering the telephone
•Filing 
•Word Processing
•Working with databases
•Creating social media content
•Working on projects to help attract and engage volunteers nationally

The benefits of volunteering in this role include: 
- Gaining experience of working in an office environment 
- Developing administration skills 
- Improving your confidence 
- Being part of our friendly team!
- Access to benefits package""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425cdf4a0624f3ab9fb18fc;
                            :activityTitle "Volunteer Office Suport / Administrator".
