id:644fd0d70b87c029f49d1b2a :activityDescription """Do you like meeting new people and have some free evenings in the week?  

We are looking for a friendly volunteer to accompany a lady we support in Watchfield to her evening clubs, and social groups in the Swindon area.

Activities will include:
• Sharing your time in the evenings and joining a lady we support to attend evening club. 
• Joining in with organised activities at the club
• Being there for company, friendship and fun

If you would like to make a difference and make friends along the way, we would love to hear from you!""";
