id:644fd23a0b87c029f49d1ef8 :activityDescription """This role will include a wide range of general office tasks, to assist staff with supporting patients, to help ensure that patients benefit from their experience with the Mother and Baby Unit. 
Admin:
This role could encompass a wide range of general office tasks, which could include:
•	Answering the telephone 
•	Filing
•	Shredding
•	Photocopying
•	Keeping the office tidy
•	Other admin tasks as requested by the Admin Coordinator
•	Some computer work may be necessary

Reception:
•	Provide a friendly welcome to visitors
•	Engage with patients and carers
•	Provide feedback to staff from patient/carer engagement
•	Respond to queries and provide information 

""";
