id:644fd2cd0b87c029f49d2358 :activityDescription """We need a volunteer to support our IT team with their laptop refresh project in London. Better supporting this team ensures everyone at Breast Cancer Now is better equipped to provide our life-changing services.

You will be preparing and replacing the laptops of staff in the London office and helping them set up their profile. This could include:

•	Building the laptops from an automated process
•	Maintaining our laptop management records
•	Contacting staff to arrange a time to swap their old laptop with a new one 
•	Sitting with staff members to get them logged into the new laptop and make sure their profile is working correctly on the new laptop 
•	Arranging OneDrive migration with our IT engineers
•	Following up with staff
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641077db1de5ad3c9cbff170;
                            :activityTitle "IT Support Volunteer".
