id:644fd77c5c28d8e407a0b1fe :activityDescription """About the opportunity
Greenpeace Local Group - Local Press and Media Co-ordinator

Do you enjoy creative writing? Have you got an eye for a striking photo? Would you like to get involved in campaigning on global issues in your local area?

Then Greenpeace Group’s Local Press and Media Co-ordinator role could be right up your street! We're looking for Local Press and Media Co-ordinators to join our groups in Penzance, Preston, and Welwyn Garden City.

About Greenpeace Local Groups:

Local Groups provide a public face to Greenpeace campaigns in the area and bring expertise and energy that are vital to Greenpeace’s successes as a campaigning organisation. In addition to campaigning, Local Groups also organise fundraising activities and events like film screenings and gigs.

About Greenpeace UK
The underlying goal of all our work is a green and peaceful world – an earth that is ecologically healthy and able to nurture life in all its diversity. To this end, we investigate, expose and confront environmental abuse by governments and corporations around the world. We champion environmentally responsible and socially just solutions, including scientific and technical innovation.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64104a51506e6c8b5704980a;
                            :activityTitle "Greenpeace Local Press and Media Co-ordinator".
