id:644ff91812535322aa32a918 :activityDescription """We are busy distributing surplus food to our partner charities and helping to prevent food waste. To make the most of the surplus food we receive we also cook meals to be supplied to our partner charities in our commercial kitchens.

What will I be doing?
In our commercial kitchen, you will support our trained kitchen staff to help turn good surplus food into delicious meals, through food sorting, preparation, cooking and packaging.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641080bdf4e70ca28bb5e075;
                            :activityTitle "Food Preparation Assistant".
id:644ff91812535322aa32a919 :address "Station St, Nottingham NG2, UK";
                            :latitude "52.9478186"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "-1.1438256"^^xsd:double.
id:644ff92112535322aa32ab7c :activityDescription """We are looking for a volunteer to support our work, through implementing communications and marketing actions to raise awareness and help develop the brand awareness of FareShare in your region.  


What will I be doing?
•	Reviewing & improving our communications plan 
•	Ensuring our website and social media are kept up to date 
•	Reviewing our marketing materials and designing new ones 
•	Developing a media contacts list 
•	Raising awareness of local community appeals and attend local events 
•	Celebrating the work we do, and developing case studies and testimonials from our community food members and food donors  
•	Writing press releases and producing infographics 
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641080bdf4e70ca28bb5e075;
                            :activityTitle "Marketing Assistant ".
id:644ff92112535322aa32ab7d :address "St Johns Court Ashford Business Park, Sevington, Willesborough, Ashford TN24 0SJ, UK";
                            :latitude "51.1321149"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "0.9027329"^^xsd:double.
id:644ff92212535322aa32ac0e :activityDescription """This role is an important cog in the work of FareShare. You will help us to ensure the smooth running of the charity behind the scenes, helping with the day-to-day operation of the warehouse and assist with daily orders for the local charities we support. You’ll be the friendly voice on the end of the phone.


What will I be doing?
Tasks will vary but could include: 
•	Answering and re-directing phone calls and greeting visitors   
•	Updating the volunteer rota   
•	Contacting our partner charities & community groups to help ensure that charities get the types of food they need 
•	Working with databases to create food orders for charities, helping to produce paperwork to support warehouse teams to process orders 
•	Checking delivery schedules and maintaining paperwork for daily van deliveries  
•	Using Google maps to map van routes  
•	Helping to record satisfaction levels among our partner charities and local communities by gathering and recording feedback  
•	Answer any queries our charity members may have with the help of a relevant team member when needed  
•	Ensure food is allocated in accordance with membership levels and food profiles 
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641080bdf4e70ca28bb5e075;
                            :activityTitle "Admin Assistant".
id:644ff92212535322aa32ac0f :address "St Johns Court Ashford Business Park, Sevington, Willesborough, Ashford TN24 0SJ, UK";
                            :latitude "51.1321149"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "0.9027329"^^xsd:double.
id:644ff92812535322aa32aeff :activityDescription """At FareShare, we have a range of voluntary roles that allow our people to do good and feel good, here are just a few…

Driver
This role is vital to FareShare’s work; ensuring that food is safely delivered to our Community Food Members or collected from our food suppliers, planning routes, carrying out routine checks on vehicles, taking responsibility for vehicles throughout the day and reporting accidents or damage.
You’ll need a standard driving license to deliver food once or twice a week to local charities in your area!

Driver’s Assistant
Head out with our volunteer drivers, and support them in loading and unloading vans, maintenance of the vans, route planning, navigation & timekeeping.
A keen eye and great conversation are key!

Warehouse assistant
Volunteer in the warehouse to manually sort and store large deliveries of surplus food, help assemble daily deliveries for local charities & community groups and making sure the food we receive is within use by dates and handled safely.
It’s a great way to keep fit and all you need is a sturdy pair of hands!

Admin Assistant
Help us with the day-to-day operation of the warehouse and assist with daily orders for the local charities we support, updating the volunteer Rota, logging food orders on our online system and answering queries from stakeholders. You’ll be the friendly voice on the end of the phone – our Regional Centres are a hub of activity getting food out to where it’s needed, and with your help we can run a tight ship!

Other roles
As well as those mentioned, we have a range of additional roles that are available depending on your region and availability.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641080bdf4e70ca28bb5e075;
                            :activityTitle "Become a FareShare Food Hero!".
id:644ff92812535322aa32af00 :address "Deptford Trading Estate, Blackhorse Rd, London SE8 5HY, UK";
                            :latitude "51.484291"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "-0.039012"^^xsd:double.
