                            :longitude "-0.0580414"^^xsd:double.
id:6450e4de2c7a6469679a89c5 :activityDescription """From getting your hands dirty and helping create and manage important wetlands habitat, to inspiring visitors, we have a range of opportunities available at WWW London Wetlands Centre.
We are the UK’s leading wetland conservation charity. We are working to create a world where healthy wetland nature thrives and enriches lives.
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:642ae184604189579797a503;
                            :activityTitle "Volunteer opportunities of WWT London Wetlands Centre".
id:6450e611e5cb59ce7a4805e2 :activityDescription """With support and guidance from library staff, the volunteer will undertake some or all of the following
• Preparing activity material, such as quizzes and treasure hunts, or colouring sheets 
• Organising and running activities for young readers
• Setting/clearing areas of the library for activities
• Enthusing/encouraging readers to complete the Summer Reading Challenge

This opportunity is available in libraries across Kent""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64218b12815033006ca0d7fe;
                            :activityTitle "Summer Reading Challenge".
