id:6450ed9ae1deb4f26b52da01 :cause id:64093b542eed5dcadba50897,
                                   id:64093b542eed5dcadba50899;
                            :organisationDescription """Sufra is a charity in North West London that prevents hunger, fights poverty and builds community.

With the help of our volunteers and partners, we coordinate a network of food banks, kitchens, a community shop and café. These act as a gateway for guests to access more holistic support – including welfare advice, asylum support and our award-winning community garden.

We aim to work with our guests to find solutions to their challenges together, whilst campaigning against the causes of hunger and poverty.""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/bebc319a-6bdf-4add-b0fa-00a7d9392072_2024-04-12T15:23:41.730Z.png>;
                            :organisationName "Sufra NW London";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://www.sufra-nwlondon.org.uk/>.
id:6450f2b4c88d13ac05954eb2 :cause id:64093b542eed5dcadba50897;
                            :organisationDescription """We run a monthly Repair Cafe in Lindfield, on the first Saturday of the month. At United Reform Church, 52 High Street Lindfield..
This includes Our volunteer repairing broken items, cafe, lounge, and kids table.""";
                            :organisationName "Lindfield Repair cafe";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://www.lindfieldrepaircafe.org/>.
id:6450f4c9c88d13ac0595532c :activityDescription "Help us pack the essential food items at our premises in St. Raphael's Estate and help us host our collection service at the Food Bank on Tuesdays and Thursdays. Committing to just one shift a week for the next three months will help us stay on top of the increasing demand and give you the opportunity to give back to the community.";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6450ed9ae1deb4f26b52da01;
                            :activityTitle "Food Bank volunteering".
id:6450f4c9c88d13ac0595532d :address "160 Pitfield Way, London";
