id:6454143e24210def927085b9 :activityDescription "Oxfam shops are local communities - but they are part of a global community. A global community of people united by a belief in a kinder, radically better world.  If you believe a fairer world is possible, join us today to overcome poverty - by fighting the injustices and inequalities that fuel it.  Just five minutes is enough to find your local shop and apply to volunteer:  https://volunteering.oxfam.org.uk/  By creating window displays, sorting and pricing donations, helping customers, or creating social media content, you can find a role that suits your skills and interests. No experience is necessary as full training will be given, all we ask is you're happy to work as part of a diverse and inclusive team. At Oxfam we know that everybody can make a real difference.  You will get to meet new people from your local community, and become part of a friendly and thriving team, helping make a positive change around the world.  To sign up, follow this link:  https://volunteering.oxfam.org.uk/ ";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64103c352a0eedb6aef42d3d;
                            :activityTitle "Oxfam Shop Volunteering".
