                            :organisationDescription "A sight loss diagnosis can be frightening and isolating but we are here to walk alongside every local person with sight loss from the tiniest babies to those over 100 years old. We provide vital practical and friendly support, sport and activities to visually impaired children and adults, and their families in Berkshire. Helping to develop confidence and live independent lives safely.";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/2fded92b-bd6d-445d-9071-84093f9955ae_2023-05-06T14:00:20.312Z.jpeg>;
                            :organisationName "Berkshire Vision ";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://www.berkshirevision.org.uk/>.
id:64565cc995ca88473dd24ace :cause id:64093b552eed5dcadba5089f;
                            :organisationDescription """We are a charity who works in partnership with businesses, community groups, local authorities and educational establishments to significantly improve employability and educational outcomes of young people aged under 25 years.

Our goals are to:

- increase aspiration and opportunity
- impart practical and real life, leadership, and employability skills
- provide access to role models and exposure to business environment
- support long term education and career prospects

""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/0686f4c7-4141-4e4b-987b-6ca5d1948726_2023-05-06T13:57:28.737Z.jpeg>;
                            :organisationName "Fresh Youth MK";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://www.freshyouthmk.org/>.
id:645670120287602de2bf6eba :activityDescription """Do you have strong organisational skills and want to use them to help us make a difference to the outcomes of young people? We are seeking a volunteer to join us as an administrative assistant.
As an admin volunteer, you'll play a crucial role in ensuring our organisation runs smoothly. Your responsibilities will include managing our database, organising files and documents, evidence gathering for reports,  scheduling meetings, liaising with schools, businesses, mentors and organisations as well as assisting with other administrative tasks as needed. You'll work closely with our team to help us stay on top of our workload and meet our goals.
This is a great opportunity for anyone who wants to gain experience in administration, develop their skills, and make a positive impact.
Join us in making a difference by supporting our team with your administrative skills!""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64565cc995ca88473dd24ace;
                            :activityTitle "Volunteer Administrative Assistant".
id:645670120287602de2bf6ebb :address "Milton Keynes";
                            :latitude "52.0406224"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "-0.7594171"^^xsd:double.
id:64567207178081cd6eca826f :activityDescription """We are looking for new volunteers to join us and be part of our team. You can help all girls know they can do anything and share some unforgettable moments along the way.

By volunteering with us, you’ll be helping girls build their confidence, have adventures and learn new skills. It doesn’t matter what your experience or background is, or how much time you have.  

Plus, volunteering for Girlguiding is a great way of meeting new people and taking a break from your daily routine. You can also build your own skills by taking our leadership development qualification, becoming a first aider or qualified outdoor activity instructor. Whatever it is you’re looking for, there’ll be something in it for you.
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641b3495981c98ddbe837bbb;
                            :activityTitle "Volunteer with Girlguiding Hertfordshire".
id:64567207178081cd6eca8270 :address "Stevenage";
                            :latitude "51.903761"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "-0.196612"^^xsd:double.
id:645672080a09293ca0137c70 :activityDescription """We are looking for new volunteers to join us and be part of our team. You can help all girls know they can do anything and share some unforgettable moments along the way.

By volunteering with us, you’ll be helping girls build their confidence, have adventures and learn new skills. It doesn’t matter what your experience or background is, or how much time you have.  

Plus, volunteering for Girlguiding is a great way of meeting new people and taking a break from your daily routine. You can also build your own skills by taking our leadership development qualification, becoming a first aider or qualified outdoor activity instructor. Whatever it is you’re looking for, there’ll be something in it for you.
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641b3495981c98ddbe837bbb;
                            :activityTitle "Volunteer with Girlguiding Hertfordshire".
