id:645a65d7a8dea6d2a3c4e795 :activityDescription """Unofficial Galaxies, one of the largest Star Wars fan private collections in the world, will be on show at Peterborough Cathedral this summer from the 19th July to 29th August. We will need the help of a large number of volunteers to monitor the exhibition, check tickets and assist visitors. 

Whether you're a student, retired or just looking to meet new people we have the ideal role for you, with shifts to choose from mornings, afternoons, evenings and weekends. 

More information can be found on our website:
https://www.peterborough-cathedral.org.uk/galaxies-volunteering.aspx""";
