id:645c1e29747329b0b5b1e75d :activityDescription """Picture this… you head in to a charity shop, have a browse & take something over to the till.

But what really goes on in the day-to-day life as a volunteer? It’s so much more than just helping customers and restocking shelves. It’s a rewarding experience! 

Why not come and try it for yourself and see what it’s like during our taster session?

The SVP has over 40 community shops across England and Wales which support local communities by providing affordable goods, employment and volunteering opportunities. We sell good quality preloved items at reasonable prices, play a significant role in the local reuse and sustainability agenda, and provide a visible presence of the SVP. When someone shops in one of our community shops, specialist shops or online, every purchase they make helps someone in need. """;
                            :activityOrganisation id:64179b76c83113223bf1343a;
                            :activityTitle "St Vincent de Paul Society (SVP) Retail Taster Session ".
id:645c1e29747329b0b5b1e75e :address "St Vincent's, Abbeydale Road, Nether Edge, Sheffield";
