id:64660b871eeca2d85e5d602d :activityDescription """Do you have the qualities needed to support and listen to people who will be experiencing a variety of emotions and reactions due to the death of a loved one?
Bereavement happens for a variety of reasons and having the ability to offer the emotional support through a non judgmental listening ear can be challenging but also very rewarding allowing people to work through the stages of bereavement in their own way, people may be struggling with more complex grief due to not being able to say goodbye to their loved one or to have been able to attend a funeral.
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:640f1da74e4230f618e17f70;
                            :activityTitle "Bereavement Helpline Listener Volunteer ".
