id:646b9729d557c54004a9556e :activityDescription """We are inviting you to a charity shop volunteer taster session where you can take part in a variety of activities that support the day to day running of our shops. You could be involved in customer service, processing transactions on our tills, replenishing stock on the shop floor or if you have an artistic flair, you could help create eye-catching displays to attract customers into our shop.
If you prefer to be behind the scenes, you can get involved in sorting donations and preparing items for sale.
If you enjoy the taster session, then you can consider signing up on an ongoing basis.
""";
