id:6478658bc3cb92f48fd7c635 :activityDescription """HELP NEEDED: We are currently looking for volunteer mentors in the Canterbury and Folkestone area. Mentors provide one to one support for young people and migrant women in the community. For the role we ask that you are able to see a young person for 1 or 2 hours a week (roughly), with a minimum 9 month commitment. We provide on going support and communication.
Full mentor training and safeguarding training provided and DBS check. """;
