id:65c21da9e0ce39087c534361 :cause id:64093b552eed5dcadba508a1;
                            :organisationDescription """Public Voice is a Community Interest Company (CIC) with a mission to improve neighbourhoods, the lives of the people who live in them and the public services they use.

We do this through community engagement, individual user engagement and community intervention, collecting the combined voices of citizens, gathering evidence and ultimately taking action to bring about positive change, now and in the future.

We are currently working on these projects:
Healthwatch Haringey
Haringey Advice Partnership
Haringey Reach and Connect
Social Prescribing in Haringey
Haringey Circle""";
                            :organisationName "Public Voice";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://publicvoice.london/>.
