                            :organisationDescription "We are an umbrella body offering support to local voluntary and community organisations; we are also a volunteer centre dealing with enquiries about volunteering, recruitment and advertising; we also run two projects for the elderly/isolated of Swale - a Transport Scheme and a Befriending Scheme.";
                            :organisationName "Swale CVS".
