                            :longitude "0.4866879"^^xsd:double.
id:660293f52589279e9bcb3e99 :activityDescription """Charity Shop volunteers are needed to work serving customers and sorting donations. Our charity shop is open weekdays 10am to 3pm. DBS checks are required for all Blackthorn Trust’s volunteers and staff.

Volunteers work both front of house (assisting customers, taking payments, tidying stock etc.) and sorting/pricing donations. There is no charity shop manager so volunteers are required to work unsupervised as part of a team.

Time commitment: A minimum of 1 weekday per week (9.50am to 3.10pm). We most urgently need volunteers on Monday, Tuesdays and Fridays but would love to hear from people who match the skills description and are available any weekday.
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64523fbd0076ca958b7f179e;
                            :activityTitle "Blackthorn Charity Shop Volunteer".
id:660293f52589279e9bcb3e9a :address "Blackthorn Trust (charity), Saint Andrew's Road, Maidstone";
