id:6602a213c3a10c424074ffa9 :activityDescription """Volunteers are needed to work helping with breadmaking or cooking workshops for people attending our Mental Health and Long-Term Health Conditions programmes. DBS checks are required for all Blackthorn Trust’s volunteers and staff.

Breadmaking/cooking workshop volunteers are required to support service users to complete tasks set by the Workshop Leader.

Time commitment: A minimum of 1/2 day per week. We need volunteers on Mondays (10am – 1pm), Tuesdays (10am – 1pm) or Wednesdays (9am – 1pm).
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64523fbd0076ca958b7f179e;
                            :activityTitle "Blackthorn Cooking Workshop Volunteer".
