                            :organisationDescription "Tutor The Nation is a new charity working towards a fairer education system in the UK. We aim to help State school pupils develop the confidence and skills they need to achieve their goals through free, online tutoring delivered by passionate volunteers. Our volunteers are helping to transform lives, one tutoring session at a time.";
