id:660d398feaba3272be46fa6b :activityDescription """The COVID pandemic highlighted the need for many communities to be better prepared in the event of significant disruption to normal life from causes often outside our control. 

We need to create a bank of volunteers that may be able to help out during any potential emergencies. These could be but not limited to: 

- Local flooding 

- Major heat waves

- Major outbursts of an infectious disease (such as COVID) 

- Low temperatures and/or snow

- Major storms and gales

- Extended loss of electricity supply 



These rare occasions may provide a range of vital duties that volunteers can fullfil such as: 

- office administration 

- telephoning people 

- delivering leaflets 

- transporting vulnerable people 

- helping out in Care homes 

- supporting local hospitals 

There really are lots of jobs to do to make sure we can deal with and recover from emergencies efficiently and in the shortest possible time. 



Your details will be added to our email list and we will contact you through email when an opportunity comes available. There is no requirement for you help out when the time comes. These emergencies are rare occurrences so it isn't expected volunteers to be regularly called upon. It is however, reassuring to know that support is there if it is required. """;
                            :activityOrganisation id:660d37262235803258230a57;
                            :activityTitle "Emergency Response /Crisis Support Volunteer ".
id:660d4a32951cf16a06410b5c :activityDescription """A Portsmouth school is looking for volunteers to assist with their early years after school club.

This club runs for children in Year R – Year 1.

You will be providing additional support to the staff and children whilst engaging in fun activities that support children’s physical development such as team games, dance, playground pals and funky fingers.

Skills needed:
16 years and over
Enjoy working with children
Patient working with younger children
Good communication skills
Reliable """;
                            :activityOrganisation id:660d37262235803258230a57;
                            :activityTitle "Early years after school club at Portsmouth School Volunteers - Together in Hive".
