id:6643750e9eb881363e80b941 :activityDescription """Come and experience the magic of Girlguiding with a taster day at our London HQ!

It’s a day to get a taste of the fun, friendship, adventure and team building we have at Girlguiding.

Expect activities like:

Sucker Archery
Team building activities: Tangrams, gutter ball challenge, tower of Hanoi, and nail challenge
Programme activities: Guiding in a bubble (Brownies), Rainbow Challenge (Guides) and Open the gate (Rangers)
Crafty activities: Colouring – to make a big Girlguiding logo, Friendship bracelets and Bolt and Screw man keyring

Whether you want to see what it’s like being a Girlguiding volunteer (adult or young), or the fun our girls  have with us, there’s something here for you.

Want to find out more about our fun and flexible volunteering opportunities? Take a look at this page:

https://www.girlguiding.org.uk/get-involved/become-a-volunteer/

Want to find out more about registering your child as  young member? Take a look at this page: 

https://www.girlguiding.org.uk/information-for-parents/register-a-child/
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:65b8d056381db807e5fb1584;
                            :activityTitle "Girlguiding unit meeting taster day at Girlguiding HQ";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:66448cc2b6943183ccd9f359 :activityDescription "Community Mentors support children aged 10-17 years who are involved or who are at risk of offending behaviour and/or exploitation.  The mentors meet with the mentee in the community, once a week for about an hour.  The mentoring relationship usually lasts for between 6 and 12 months.  The mentors support the mentees to work towards goals, be a listening ear, working through issues, develop their life skills, increase their confidence, self-esteem, and motivation.  They achieve this through various activities which could be from going for something to eat to doing something active or getting creative.   ";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6410436d0f64c8ee13976738;
                            :activityTitle "Community Mentoring in Wiltshire";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
