id:66562279320c1ef982cddca3 :activityDescription """Do you  have a passion for walking and the protection of the natural beauty of the countryside? Sussex Ramblers are looking for someone to support the Chair who is willing to help lead the Area Team with good humour and patience.  If you have excellent communication skills and are willing to be part of a team you will fit right in. 

Experience of walking routes and environments in East and West Sussex is useful but not essential as you can acquire this knowledge as you go.  Sussex Ramblers oversees the activities of their groups and the footpath teams in both West and East Sussex. You would deputise in the absence of the Chair by leading Area Team Meetings and undertake specific projects in agreement with the Chair.

This role can be shared and we offer training & support for all our volunteers. For this role you do need to be a member of The Ramblers.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:65e09d1a4a3343b239bca62f;
                            :activityTitle "Vice Chair - Sussex Area";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:66564c24ebc8551d1aefa499 :activityDescription """An excellent opportunity to gain commercial experience with gathering sales leads, manage social media, and general marketing duties.

Full training will be given. UK residents can apply. Note the role is home based, there is no need to come into the office.

We have helped many volunteers gain full-time employment with our training programs.

Please contact David
david@providr.uk

""";
