id:665deba94aee6e048033a800 :activityDescription """VOLUNTEER VACANCY
Duties & Tasks:
Ensure the information in the organisation's databases remains up-to-date and accurate.
Write reports to summarise interview and experiment findings
Maintain files and information regarding research.
Create spreadsheets and graphs to help other Volunteers in the organisation. 
Conduct research as requested and required by various Departments.
Skills & Qualities:
The ability to work with data and analytics.
Open to working in a team and alongside other Volunteers/Departments as well as conducting duties independently.
Administration and organisational abilities.
Excellent written and verbal communication.
Good time-management.
Critical thinking and attention to detail.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:665dad56103207cef4a1b743;
