                            :longitude "-1.4671882"^^xsd:double.
id:667d454fc634b562cd4bab32 :activityDescription """Our Home Visiting Befriending Scheme was set up to help alleviate some of the isolation that may be caused by visual impairment, for example in a situation where someone has very little contact with friends and family.
A Befriender helps in many different ways such as visiting and having a cup of tea & a chat, agreed shopping or outings together, or more practical help with reading mail or the newspaper. Many of our volunteers and service users build up a very good, long term, trusting relationship.
For more information please call 01332 292262 or email enquiries@sightsupportderbyshire.org.uk
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6435447b1bfec300aba85039;
                            :activityTitle "Befriending Volunteer";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:667d45aa461b1a01f5db6d86 :address "From Home";
                            :latitude "52.5647271"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "-1.4671882"^^xsd:double.
id:667d68dafae84866c0685625 :activityDescription """We want to provide a personal thank you to as many Macmillan supporters and volunteers as possible. Whether they have volunteered their time, raised funds or donated, we want to ensure they know how much we appreciate their support. That’s where our card writing volunteers come in. We will deliver a card writing pack with instructions, cards and a list of addresses. So find a time that works for you, pop on your favourite playlist, make a cuppa and get writing using the pointers we give you to make a real impact on the people you’re thanking.

Further info:
Suggested number of volunteers: 1-20
Availability: Upon request (Four weeks’ notice required) Time commitment: 1-3 hours
Location: Your workplace/location of your choice
*Please note that we ask partners to cover the cost of posting these cards second class""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:665de4919155fda1cf3f31d9;
                            :activityTitle "Card Writing";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:667d6b4ba959848a2d8a54dc :activityDescription """When a person has cancer, they can often go without the essentials, let alone treats, that make them feel special. That’s where you could make a huge difference this winter. We are looking for volunteers to get involved with our Winter Warmer campaign and help put together care packages to provide extra comfort and support to people affected by cancer in your local area.

Volunteers will have a choice of Macmillan services across the UK to support and deliver their care packages to. So gather a team of volunteers, source items and get together to create your care packages. We will then connect you with a local Macmillan service for you to deliver your care packages to, who will make sure the care packages go to the people who need them most.

Further info:
Suggested number of volunteers: 10 +
Availability: Upon request (Six weeks’ notice required) Time commitment: 1-2 hours
Location: Your workplace/location of your choice (We can support partners across multiple locations simultaneously)
https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=Emwb0Gf8IUeYGHkx2LmkckcegNZjbLhAqQexec6xZ-RUNkdQMFVPQlpHS0dOQ1ZKSVZTTlk2VEZNMS4u""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:665de4919155fda1cf3f31d9;
                            :activityTitle "Join our Winter Warmer Care Package Campaign";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
