id:667ef8e1cf7fa2efe6d118a8 :activityDescription """Your role is to assist in delivering engaging and inspiring sessions on how to make a house feel more homely, fostering a sense of comfort and well-being among participants. By offering your support and creating a welcoming environment, you empower participants to explore different aspects of home decoration and organisation, helping them to create a space that feels personal and inviting.
""";
