id:667efe2b0ce2d20db71e6170 :activityDescription "Your role is to assist in delivering engaging and inspiring well-being sessions, fostering a healthier and happier community. By offering your support and creating a welcoming environment, you empower participants to explore different aspects of well-being and make positive lifestyle choices. Activities may include meditation, facial massage, makeup classes, drama, dance therapy, gardening, boxing, nutrition, singing, arts & crafts.";
