id:667f02f070e64aadbb70e9e0 :activityDescription """Purpose of the Role: 
To support the delivery of engaging and inclusive literacy and creative writing sessions as part of the Baytree Centre’s GEMS (Grow Enjoy Move Study) programme for girls aged 5–18. By creating a safe, inspiring, and encouraging environment, you will help participants develop their reading, writing, and storytelling skills, as well as build confidence in self-expression. Working alongside staff, you will assist with planning and facilitating activities that nurture creativity, imagination, and a love of language. 

