id:66952e677fc72502a9edd6ff :activityDescription "To meet weekly with service users who reside in one of WAITS refuge accommodation (Iona 1, 2, 3 or 4) to reduce social isolation and improve confidence. Undertaking an inclusive activity for all residents to enjoy, this can be an indoor or outdoor activity, ensure new residents feel involved, welcome and safe, taking into considerations backgrounds and diversity. Take donations where possible to the refuge to provide refuge service users with food and toiletries.";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425f9bff2d4b77a6e15f5b0;
                            :activityTitle "Refuge Volunteer";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
