                            :longitude "-1.4671882"^^xsd:double.
id:66e2d10fb743db13780353d4 :activityDescription "Creation and scheduling of posts on Nature Vibezzz social media accounts (Facebook page / group, Instagram and Twitter). Helping staff create content that promotes charity activities and events to increase supporters, participants and charity profile. Creating content that support charity aims and promote charity work online through blogs, newsletters and social media.Work can mainly be done remotely from home, but volunteer will have the opportunity to come to activities for creation of media (photographing and filming activities, gaining quotes from staff and participants, etc).";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425d78aa0624f3ab9fbf09d;
                            :activityTitle "Social Media Volunteer";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
