                            :longitude "0.0427169"^^xsd:double.
id:67ae8a5086a54ef8ff81610e :activityDescription """Shanti Bhavan is looking for a creative, experienced photographer or videographer to serve as Media Volunteer. Our Media Volunteer resides on the beautiful Shanti Bhavan campus in India, and helps produce content for our website and social media platforms. The minimum length of stay for a media volunteer is two weeks.

This is a unique opportunity to immerse yourself in a close-knit community with the common goal of poverty alleviation through world-class education. Your experience as a Media Volunteer will allow you to bring awareness to Shanti Bhavan’s important mission while giving you an opportunity to explore and develop your own storytelling skills in a one-of-a-kind environment.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6786d6718ba9164aee2bd538;
                            :activityTitle "Illuminating Voices, Breaking Barriers: Join us as a Media Volunteer";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:67af1faf577d6d522998f1dd :cause id:64093b542eed5dcadba50897;
                            :organisationDescription """Red hall Community Centre is managed by Red hall Community Association, a registered unincorporated charity.  Our charity number is 508251.

The Association was established in June 1978 and six trustees all of whom are annually elected.  The current chairman is Martin Landers (martin.landers@outlook.com), the secretary is Sarah Small.

Red hall Community Centre is situated at the heart of the Red hall Estate,  in Red Hall and Lingfield Ward in Darlington.  Red hall is 3 miles from the town centre and surrounded by industrial estates and farmland.

Getting to the Community Centre couldn’t be easier no matter if you are walking, using public transport or driving.

""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/68f39e18-aeec-4584-ab13-3afbd66c8c63_2025-02-14T10:49:18.369Z.jpeg>;
                            :organisationName "Red Hall Community Centre";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://redhallcommunitycentre.org/>.
