id:67bc89311adcce62b1a78796 :activityDescription """Volunteer will support Nature Vibezzz staff and they assist them in their role of running community project, family forest school activities.

Tasks/ Responsibilities:

▪	Help with forest school / natural outdoor play / craft activities.
▪	Help with upkeep of tools / equipment.
▪	Help with supervision of participants / children.
▪	Help set up and tidy up after activity.
▪	Help Nature Vibezzz staff record activity (attendance sheet, feed back forms, photos etc).

The role shall include some management responsibilities.

Requirements:

Willingness to be outdoor in all seasons and weathers.

Volunteer need to be enthusiastic, confident, good communicator, happy to work with the community especially children.

The volunteer shall need to be put through a DBS check as they shall be working with vulnerable adults and children.

Volunteer shall need to complete appropriate paperwork to be under Nature Vibezzz insurance.

Benefits:

The volunteer will have the opportunity to take part in training provided by Nature Vibezzz or free &/or project funded training provided by other organisations.The volunteer will have the opportunity to take part in Nature Vibezzz project events.

The volunteer will receive travel expenses (proof of expenses will be needed to claim money) while volunteering on Nature Vibezzz projects when funding is available.
Nature Vibezzz provides references for all volunteers.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425d78aa0624f3ab9fbf09d;
                            :activityTitle "Forest School Volunteer";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
