id:67ebf98fec33913d07796cdc :activityDescription """Love meeting new people? Want to make a real difference in your community?

Join FoodCycle as a Hosting Volunteer and help create a warm, welcoming space where everyone can enjoy a free, nutritious meal.

You'll play a key role in making guests feel at home - serving food, sharing meals, encouraging conversation, and helping with the clean-up. No experience? No problem! Our friendly FoodCycle Leaders will guide you through the session, making sure everything runs smoothly.

Why volunteer with FoodCycle?
✅ Make an impact – Help bring people together over a free, nourishing meal.
✅ Learn new skills – Build confidence, teamwork, and communication skills.
✅ Meet great people – Be part of a friendly, supportive team.
✅ Volunteer flexibly – No minimum commitment, join when you can! Sessions last around 3 hours

About FoodCycle:
FoodCycle is a national charity running 100+ community meals every week. We use food that would otherwise go to waste to create free, nutritious meals for anyone who needs them. But it’s more than just a meal—it’s a chance to chat, make friends, and feel part of your community.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:65d604686123f8876966688d;
                            :activityTitle "FoodCycle Hosting Volunteer - help us serve community meals (North England)";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
