Join FoodCycle as a Food Collection Driver and help rescue surplus food so we can turn it into delicious, three-course meals for your community!

You’ll be the vital link helping collect food donations and delivering them to our volunteer cooks - so they can work their magic in the kitchen.

Why volunteer as a Food Collection Driver?
🚗 Be a food hero – Help save good food from going to waste and turn it into something amazing.
🎯 Make a real impact – Provide free, nutritious meals for those who need them.
⏳ Volunteer on your terms – No minimum commitment, just help when you can!
💰 No out-of-pocket costs – We cover mileage expenses!

About FoodCycle:
FoodCycle is a national charity running 100+ community meals every week. We use food that would otherwise go to waste to create free, nutritious meals for anyone who needs them. But it’s more than just a meal—it’s a chance to chat, make friends, and feel part of your community.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:65d604686123f8876966688d;
                            :activityTitle "FoodCycle Surplus Food Collection Driver";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
