id:682c861ac72480c2b4a2eace :activityDescription """Do you have a love of reading? 
Could you share that love with children in a local primary school?
Can you make a weekly afternoon commitment?

If you answered yes to these questions; we need you!

Coram Beanstalk has a long standing history of training volunteers to go into local primary schools and support children to grow a love of reading. 
You will be trained how to not just listen to children read, but also how to engage them in conversation about books and how to encourage them to find books they love. 

We provide training in small, online, interactive group sessions with one of our trainers as well as providing ongoing support once you are placed in school.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425d5f5a0624f3ab9fbc763;
                            :activityTitle "Coram Beanstalk: In person reading help in school";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:682c861ac72480c2b4a2eacf :address "Ionic St, Birkenhead CH42 2BL, UK";
                            :latitude "53.3736643"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "-3.0102224"^^xsd:double.
