id:683d8c07fcf95f2ed878455c :cause id:64093b552eed5dcadba508a3;
                            :organisationDescription "Community Energy Birmingham is a Society for Community Benefit. Our primary aim is to produce social benefit for the communities that we work with and to reduce carbon emissions in the city of Birmingham. We do this by raising money to install and own renewable energy systems connected to community buildings, mainly using solar PV panels.";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/7de68972-061b-481d-8d05-0f532d2e649c_2025-06-02T11:33:26.863Z.jpeg>;
