id:683d8ea1cc66aeef4b0af924 :cause id:64093b552eed5dcadba508a3;
                            :organisationDescription "CHARGE stands for Claverdon Harnessing Alternative Renewable Green Energy (perhaps the parish’s first AI generated name). It has been set up as a Community Interest Company (CIC) with the objective of helping Claverdon to become a leading example of the efficient use of renewable energy.";
