id:683d97f916132c2af221c9c9 :activityDescription """Should the Community Energy groups move thier focus from energy generation to energy storage ? 

I want to research the merits of energy storage and grid balancing assests in shared ownership rather than PV systems. This is born out of my developing opinion that Community Energy should be balancing the grid (buying low and selling high, like the for-profits currently enjoy) rather than continue to add solar which is exacerbating imabalance if you look at the grid demand last summer (duck curve). """;
                            :activityOrganisation id:683d8c07fcf95f2ed878455c;
                            :activityTitle "Forming a thinktank to look at energy storage and grid balancing in shared ownership";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
