id:684ff8d4c7cc137e37aa46c5 :activityDescription """Would you like to gain experience of fundraising and help us to continue our important work in the community?

Our Fundraising Manager is building a team of handy helpers to monitor collection boxes and source raffles prizes from across Tunbridge Wells as well as talking to local businesses about becoming corporate partners.

If you have a confident and friendly disposition and are passionate about mental health we’d love to hear from you!""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:66422f0e845341afe3f25e16;
                            :activityTitle "Fundraising Volunteer";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:684ff8d4c7cc137e37aa46c6 :address "2a Grosvenor Park, Tunbridge Wells, Kent TN1 2BD";
