id:684ffee21b577a04505dafae :activityDescription """The Isabel Blackman Centre is a much-loved community venue in the heart of the Old Town, Hastings providing a haven for health, wellbeing, and leisure. Facilities include an exercise studio and gym, café restaurant, activity and event space, treatment rooms, accessible bathing facilities and a community shop. Designed specifically for the over 50’s but a venue that everyone in the community can enjoy. 

The Café Volunteer is a key part of the café and catering team providing great food and service at the heart of our Centre. Working alongside our Head Chef, Kitchen & Café Assistant and other volunteers you will help ensure our café / restaurant is well known for its enticing, healthy and affordable menus and the amazing experience we offer. We are currently looking for a volunteer to help in the Cafe on Sunday lunchtimes.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:66324bcff384b9c7d01f7b92;
                            :activityTitle "Cafe Volunteer - Isabel Blackman Centre";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:684ffee21b577a04505dafaf :address "Winding Street, Hastings TN34 3AT";
