id:686663c32652d3fffb532705 :activityDescription """Do you enjoy working with children, bringing history to life, and helping others have a great day out? Join our team as an Education Volunteer and play a key role in creating memorable learning experiences for school groups visiting Lewes Castle & Museum or Anne of Cleves House.

This role involves supporting the delivery of educational visits at our Lewes heritage properties, helping to welcome and guide school groups, assist teachers with orientation, and ensure the safety and smooth running of the day. Duties include preparing learning spaces, escorting groups around the site, supporting educational activities, and assisting in emergencies.

The role may take place at Lewes Castle & Museum or Anne of Cleves House, dependent upon where the educational visit is taking place.
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64260070f2d4b77a6e16a5a5;
                            :activityTitle "Education Volunteer - Lewes";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:686663c32652d3fffb532706 :address "52 Southover High St, Lewes BN7 1JA, UK";
                            :latitude "50.8689915"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "0.004041299999999999"^^xsd:double.
id:686663c38d3cb3dd43b2795b :activityDescription """Do you enjoy working with children, bringing history to life, and helping others have a great day out? Join our team as an Education Volunteer and play a key role in creating memorable learning experiences for school groups visiting Lewes Castle & Museum or Anne of Cleves House.

This role involves supporting the delivery of educational visits at our Lewes heritage properties, helping to welcome and guide school groups, assist teachers with orientation, and ensure the safety and smooth running of the day. Duties include preparing learning spaces, escorting groups around the site, supporting educational activities, and assisting in emergencies.

The role may take place at Lewes Castle & Museum or Anne of Cleves House, dependent upon where the educational visit is taking place.
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64260070f2d4b77a6e16a5a5;
