                            :longitude "0.007595899999999999"^^xsd:double.
id:686664a39d8369d089cad97f :activityDescription """Join our team as a Maintenance Volunteer at the historic Lewes Castle and Anne of Cleves House!

We’re looking for practical, hands-on volunteers to help us care for these incredible heritage sites, ensuring they remain safe, well-maintained, and ready to welcome visitors year-round. Whether you’re supporting routine upkeep, setting up for events, or helping implement health and safety measures, your contribution will play a key role in preserving these remarkable buildings. Shifts are flexible (ideally one every two weeks), and you’ll be part of a friendly, dedicated team.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64260070f2d4b77a6e16a5a5;
                            :activityTitle "Maintenance Volunteer - Lewes";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:686664a39d8369d089cad980 :address "52 Southover High St, Lewes BN7 1JA, UK";
                            :latitude "50.8689915"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "0.004041299999999999"^^xsd:double.
id:686664a3d71fde994fcd66c1 :activityDescription """Join our team as a Maintenance Volunteer at the historic Lewes Castle and Anne of Cleves House!

We’re looking for practical, hands-on volunteers to help us care for these incredible heritage sites, ensuring they remain safe, well-maintained, and ready to welcome visitors year-round. Whether you’re supporting routine upkeep, setting up for events, or helping implement health and safety measures, your contribution will play a key role in preserving these remarkable buildings. Shifts are flexible (ideally one every two weeks), and you’ll be part of a friendly, dedicated team.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64260070f2d4b77a6e16a5a5;
