id:6866659c95ea0b6033db0656 :activityDescription """Become a Visitor Experience Volunteer and help bring history to life at Lewes Castle and Anne of Cleves House!

We’re looking for friendly, enthusiastic individuals to welcome visitors, sell tickets and shop items, and provide helpful information to ensure every guest has a fantastic experience. You’ll play a key role in creating a warm, engaging atmosphere and supporting the ongoing success of these incredible heritage sites.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64260070f2d4b77a6e16a5a5;
                            :activityTitle "Visitor Experience Volunteer - Lewes";
