id:686b3868aedc1d70ceb514bd :activityDescription "Why not come and join us to sit and collect observational data at Kessingland Suffolk. This research assistant post requires no previous knowledge or training. Our project aims to develop and test superior signs to safeguard endangered birds from disturbances from dog walking. We need your help to test the effectiveness of these new signs by observing dog walker behaviour on a beautiful beach in Suffolk. You won’t be challenging or confronting anyone, just sitting quietly and recording a few notes on how well the signs seem to be working; and of course enjoying your surroundings. Feel free to sign up with a friend so that you can have a natter while you gather data that will help safeguard vulnerable birds.";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64119bf12a79fbd15e8912b6;
                            :activityTitle "RSPB Team Member (Research assistant (no training/experience required) at Kessingland Suffolk)";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation true.
id:686b3868aedc1d70ceb514be :address "London Road, NR33 7PQ, London Road, Kessingland, Lowestoft, Suffolk, NR33 7PQ, United Kingdom";
                            :latitude "52.432585"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "1.720912"^^xsd:double.
