                            :organisationDescription """We provide Emergency and Critical care thorough our Helicopter and Road services work tirelessly to save lives and alleviate pain and suffering wherever and whenever possible.  

TAAS is committed to safeguarding and promoting the welfare of children, young people and adults and expects all our staff and volunteers to share our commitment.""";
