id:686e9161a24accded7122032 :activityDescription """Sunday 12th October 2025.

Volunteer with WWF-UK at the Royal Parks Half Marathon

No event would be complete without the roar of Team WWF volunteers cheering on our fabulous fundraisers doing their thing to help bring our world back to life! And we would absolutely love for you to come and join us!

Join our water point and give runners a much-needed boost, and keep everyone hydrated! Support our incredible Team Panda runners as they race to save our world.  

What’s in It for You? Soak up the exciting event day buzz, as well as claim a WWF T-shirt to wear on the day and keep as a thank you for your support.  

Who Can Volunteer? We require you to be over 18 for the water point role. If you would like to volunteer and you are under 18, you can join our cheer point instead when accompanied by an adult.

What You’ll Receive:

A WWF t-shirt to wear on the day
Pre-event communications with all the key info

What to Bring:

Weather-appropriate clothing and sturdy footwear
A fully charged mobile phone
A reusable water bottle
Sun cream

We aim to make our volunteer roles inclusive and will do our best to accommodate any access needs. 

Why Volunteer?

Meet like-minded people who care about the planet
Gain valuable event experience
Support WWF’s mission to protect nature and wildlife

To sign up, please visit our website.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:68371acd058df974d4600d9e;
                            :activityTitle "Royal Parks Half Marathon - Water Point Volunteer";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
