id:686fa8ed1211135694cba944 :activityDescription """Get ready for the Red Shoe Walk!  A fun, family-friendly walk around the outskirts of Meadowhall on Sunday the 3rd August.

You can don your own pair of red shoes, or grab a free pair of red shoe covers before walking the 3km route to raise funds for vital dementia care projects in Sheffield.""";
