id:686fb50ee029c918e4ebd956 :activityDescription """Mitie Foundation x DWP

📍 Location: multiple locations
🕙 Time: 09:30 AM – 4:00 PM
We’re inviting Mitie colleagues to volunteer and join Mitie Foundation team and Recruiting Team at our upcoming Employer Engagement Days, where we’ll be supporting jobseekers—particularly those facing barriers to employment—on their journey into roles within Mitie Security. 
As a volunteer, you’ll help participants:
•	Build confidence through CV writing and interview coaching
•	Understand the application process for Mitie roles
•	Explore career opportunities in the security sector
Why Your Support Matters:
This event is part of our commitment to inclusive hiring—creating opportunities for individuals from underrepresented backgrounds, and by volunteering, you’ll be helping to create better places and thriving communities, while also sharing your knowledge and experience to inspire others.
Interested in getting involved?
Please sign up
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:65b7befedcc4366de5311230;
                            :activityTitle "🌟 Volunteer with Purpose: Support an Employability Engagement Day 🌟";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
