                            :longitude "-0.2869265"^^xsd:double.
id:68707e808d829313a23387f9 :activityDescription "Why not come and join us to sit and collect observational data at Sutton heath in Suffolk. This research assistant post requires no previous knowledge or training. Our project aims to develop and test superior signs to safeguard endangered birds from disturbances from dog walking. We need your help to test the effectiveness of these new signs by observing dog walker behaviour on a beautiful Heathland in Suffolk. You won’t be challenging or confronting anyone, just sitting quietly and recording a few notes on how well the signs seem to be working; and of course enjoying your surroundings. Feel free to sign up with a friend so that you can have a natter while you gather data that will help safeguard vulnerable birds.";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64119bf12a79fbd15e8912b6;
                            :activityTitle "RSPB Team Member (Research assistant (no training/experience required) at Sutton heath in Suffolk.)";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation true.
id:68707e808d829313a23387fa :address ", Sutton, IP12 3JD, United Kingdom";
                            :latitude "52.068085"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "1.374694"^^xsd:double.
id:68707e879d85a6e0b1cb518e :activityDescription "Why not come and join us to sit and collect observational data at Westleton Heath Nature Reserve. This research assistant post requires no previous knowledge or training. Our project aims to develop and test superior signs to safeguard endangered birds from disturbances from dog walking. We need your help to test the effectiveness of these new signs by observing dog walker behaviour on a beautiful Heathland in Suffolk. You won’t be challenging or confronting anyone, just sitting quietly and recording a few notes on how well the signs seem to be working; and of course enjoying your surroundings. Feel free to sign up with a friend so that you can have a natter while you gather data that will help safeguard vulnerable birds.";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64119bf12a79fbd15e8912b6;
