id:6874f4b101db0d3698f30716 :activityDescription """Volunteer Kids Activity Monitors for H&F Community Day, Saturday 19 July

London Borough of Hammersmith & Fulham are hosting a Community Day event on Saturday 19th July and are seeking enthusiastic, reliable and confident volunteers to help out on the day.

Volunteer Kids Activity Monitors will oversee and manage crowds on various kids activities including face painting and circus skills, liaise with the activity leader to ensure they are not over crowded and have time to take breaks. Please note that you will not be expected to deliver the children's activities.

You will need the following skills:
• Good with children
• Friendly and approachable
• Team player

Volunteers will receive a free food token for refreshments during the day.

Date: Saturday 19 July 2025
Times required: 11am to 5pm
Location: Ravenscourt Park, London, W6 0UA

Interested, please email: Events@lbhf.gov.uk with the following information and you will be contacted by the Events Team:
- Name
- Number
- Emergency Contact details
- Role you’re interested in
- Times you’re available""";
