                                   id:64093b552eed5dcadba508a3;
                            :organisationDescription """Energy4All demonstrates the power of co-operation in the renewable energy sector. We have grown to become a family of more than 30 independent renewable-energy co-operatives, and those co-ops have more than 19,000 individual members.
We work with communities to develop innovative renewable energy projects, raise the funds those projects need to go forward, and work with the organisation to manage the projects over the long-term.""";
