id:687e331b017731f9a0fdf59c :activityDescription """As a Here to Help Volunteer at Blists Hill, you will play a key role in enhancing the visitor experience and supporting the Trust’s charitable aims.
You’ll be on hand to welcome and assist visitors, answering any questions they may have and ensuring they have an enjoyable and memorable visit.  You will also be in charge of hiring out the mobility scooters to visitors.
We are looking for volunteers who can commit to at least one regular shift per week.  This could be a half day or a full day, week day or weekends.

""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:687e307ae9595af0c853f2bd;
                            :activityTitle "Here to Help Volunteers at Blists Hill Victorian Town";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
