id:687e34470ced8a70b353a3f7 :activityDescription """Supporting the Front of House teams in Enginuity, you will be assisting in the Summer programming exhibit – Ready Set … GAME. This installation includes over 30 retro and current consoles, with various games to play.
You’ll be stationed in the exhibit, helping visitors use the consoles, troubleshooting, and ensuring everyone is having a good time.
We are looking for someone to commit to a long term placement of at least one month.  The exhibit runs until 1 September. Minimum one shift per week is preferred.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:687e307ae9595af0c853f2bd;
                            :activityTitle "Visitor Experience Volunteer – Ready Set Game - at Enginuity";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
