id:6880e6685d37fbf2ac37bf53 :activityDescription """We’re looking for a keen volunteer to capture high-quality photos at an upcoming event held at a renewable energy site. Your role will involve photographing key moments, speakers, the site itself, and attendees to help us showcase the impact of community energy projects. Your images will be used across our website, social media, and promotional materials to raise awareness and inspire others.

""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:67aa00bb8e0715d8c0eefd61;
                            :activityTitle "Event Content Photographer";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:6880e6685d37fbf2ac37bf54 :address "Wilson Road, London SE5 8PB";
