id:688343c2e2ef0ebb181b9c38 :activityDescription """Volunteers wanted for our busy community transport scheme in Sittingbourne.  This role is office based. You will answer calls from elderly clients who wish to book a driver to take them to their medical appointment.  You will need to use a database to log the booking so IT skills are helpful (although training will be provided).  The role also involves contacting our volunteer drivers to take clients to the appointments booked and confirm details with the clients. 

We need cover for:

Tuesdays - 12.30pm-3.30pm
Wednesdays - 12.30pm-3.30pm
Thursdays - 12.30pm-3.30pm""";
