id:6886a7dfa1c219e53bd4be50 :cause id:64093b542eed5dcadba5089b;
                            :organisationDescription """We are a small self funded cat rescue. Our mission is to rescue, rehabilitate, and rehome cats in need, giving them a second chance at a happy and fulfilling life. We believe that every cat deserves a loving and permanent home, and we work tirelessly to make that a reality.
​
Join us in our mission to make a difference in the lives of these amazing animals.​We are passionate about our cause and committed to making a positive impact on the community.""";
