id:688cccef5d9cd7459d3506db :cause id:64093b542eed5dcadba50897,
                                   id:64093b542eed5dcadba50899,
                                   id:64093b552eed5dcadba508a1;
                            :organisationDescription """We are an international humanitarian organisation that strives for a world free from poverty, fear and oppression.

Extreme geographies. Extreme climate challenges. Extreme crises. Nothing will stop Concern fighting extreme poverty. Our teams on the ground are working together with people living in the most difficult situations, to bring about lasting change to lives, livelihoods and communities.

We provide life-saving and life-changing support to communities around the world who are most vulnerable to crises. From rapid emergency response to our innovative programming in health and nutrition, livelihoods and education, we go to the hardest to reach places to make sure that no-one is left behind.""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/6b57be6d-9287-4127-9955-3c2cc2ab5529_2025-08-01T14:54:14.835Z.jpeg>;
                            :organisationName "Concern Worldwide (UK)";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://www.concern.net/>.
id:688ccf7807628396605d2019 :activityDescription """As a Shop Volunteer, you can help raise valuable funds to support Concern Worldwide's life saving work across the world.

By joining our team, you’ll:

Support vital global development work

Gain valuable retail or marketing experience to build your CV

Connect with a friendly, supportive team and make new friends

Make your local community a better place

Have fun while making a real impact!

We need passionate, friendly volunteers to help our shops thrive! Whether you have a flair for fashion, love keeping things tidy, or enjoy chatting to people, we have a role for you:

Tasks include:

Steaming and prepping donated clothes

Merchandising and styling our shop floor and window displays

Managing the till and helping customers

Running the shop floor

Adding your own creative flair to how we look and feel!

No previous experience? No problem — we’ll support you with full training and a warm welcome into our volunteer family.

Tasks and responsibilities
- Steaming and prepping donated clothes
- Merchandising and styling our shop floor and window displays
- Managing the till and helping customers
- Running the shop floor
- Taking photos for social media posts""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:688cccef5d9cd7459d3506db;
                            :activityTitle "Shop Volunteer";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
