                            :longitude "-2.7156423"^^xsd:double.
id:688d2796443c0bef2db2efdd :activityDescription """The Group the Musical is a theatre and community currently rehearsing and producing, The Group, a new musical which raises awareness of Autism and disability from the perspective of a support group and its service users during its formation and development. 

We need people to be teaching assistants to take on support roles in our rehearsals. This role is ideally for anybody with ambition for a drama directing or teaching role or in classroom support.  """;
