id:688e287fc01d8340c31ec314 :activityDescription """Use your creativity and online voice to amplify a Spirit-led movement.

We’re looking for a social-savvy volunteer to help grow Gen Z: The Roundtable across TikTok, Instagram, and YouTube Shorts. You’ll schedule and post weekly content, engage with our community, and come up with fresh ideas to boost reach and spark conversation.

Key Responsibilities:

Post 2 creative, engaging videos per week (e.g. team intros, behind-the-scenes, crowdfunding)
Manage DMs, comments, polls, and community reposts
Curate stories and share testimonies, reactions, and updates
Track analytics and adjust strategies to grow our audience
Connect with Christian influencers and creators for collabs, Lives, and guest features
Ideal for someone who:

Loves storytelling, trends, and digital creativity
Knows how to engage Gen Z audiences with meaningful content
Has a passion for Jesus and wants to use social media for impact
Is confident and experienced in creating short-form video content and building community online""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:688e259dcada85fb3e46691c;
                            :activityTitle "Social media content creator and marketer";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
