id:688e28e7c01d8340c31ec362 :activityDescription """Bring our Gen Z series to life through creative and polished editing.

We’re seeking 2 skilled video editors to craft engaging 30-minute episodes and dynamic social media snippets. You’ll sync audio, add subtitles, music, and motion graphics, ensuring smooth transitions and great pacing. Collaborate closely with the videographer and set designer to create a visually intentional final product.

Key Responsibilities:

Edit episodes (max 30 mins) and create short clips for social media
Sync audio, add subtitles, music, and light motion graphics
Ensure smooth, professional transitions and pacing
Work alongside the production team to align the final look and feel
Ideal for:

Experienced editors proficient in Premiere Pro, Final Cut Pro, DaVinci Resolve, CapCut, or similar tools
Creative individuals passionate about storytelling and visual impact
Those excited to contribute to a biblical, Spirit-led media project for Gen Z""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:688e259dcada85fb3e46691c;
                            :activityTitle "Video editor for Gen Z series";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
