id:688e298983750785d0a1ca67 :activityDescription """Help visually tell the story of a Gen Z movement.

We’re looking for a creative and skilled videographer to capture high-quality footage of filming days, roundtable discussions, and behind-the-scenes moments. You’ll set up lighting, camera angles, and audio, working closely with the director to ensure a consistent, polished look.

Key Responsibilities:

Film roundtable episodes and BTS content
Manage lighting, camera setups, and audio as needed
Operate one or multiple cameras to capture dynamic footage
Collaborate with the production team for visual consistency
Ideal for:

Camera-savvy creatives or freelancers based in London
Passionate storytellers eager to support a biblical, Spirit-led media project for Gen Z""";
