id:688e29ce83750785d0a1caa0 :activityDescription """Shape the visual vibe of a  Gen Z media project.

We’re looking for creative designers to craft the look and feel of our show—from mood boards and thumbnails to digital flyers and behind-the-scenes graphics. You’ll help style the filming location with props, backdrops, and furniture, manage set equipment, and work closely with editors and social media creators to keep visuals fresh and cohesive.

Key Responsibilities:

Create brand mood boards to guide video editors and social media teams
Design thumbnails, YouTube titles, descriptions, and tags
Produce digital flyers, story templates, and BTS graphics
Assist with set aesthetics, sourcing/designing props, signs, and furniture
Manage set equipment, budgeting, and expenses before filming
Ideal for:

Designers skilled in Canva, Photoshop, Illustrator, or similar tools
DIY creatives, interior/stage designers, and those passionate about atmosphere and style
Anyone excited to help craft an inviting, Spirit-led space for Gen Z storytelling""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:688e259dcada85fb3e46691c;
