                            :longitude "-0.0424112"^^xsd:double.
id:689484359a3b38b517cec9cf :activityDescription """We’re on the hunt for volunteers to help us identify sites that could become solar hubs in their communities!

We’re looking for volunteers who might already know of a potential site in their area, think community or commercial buildings. Ideally, it’s got a big roof, high electricity bills, and is owner-occupied.

We’re after someone who can do more than just spot a roof for a solar project. You’d also help us build and maintain a good relationship with the building owner. Basically, someone who can support the project from start to finish.

Some prerequisites for the sites are:

1. A commercial or community roof (we can’t do domestic properties)
2. Available roof space at least the size of a tennis court (250 sq m)
3. Electricity bills of at least £1,000 a month

Want some inspiration? Check out this video on capital free solar for businesses 👇

https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=byRHPPK9Zxo

If this sounds up your street and you are ready to take the next steps of getting really involved with Big Solar Co-op, please book a call in with the Content & Community Lead - Noel Lambert, here:
https://calendly.com/big-solar-co-op-noel/30min

""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6878db70cb9160db05f23ff5;
                            :activityTitle "Help us to identify suitable solar sites! ";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:689486609a3b38b517cecaab :activityDescription """We’re always looking for ways to spread the word about the fantastic work we’re doing here at The Big Solar Co-op – and part of that involves leafletting!

We’re on the hunt for keen individuals who want to get out there and shout about what we’re doing and what community energy is all about.

As we work all over the country, there’s nowhere specific we’re targeting – we’re thinking everywhere and anywhere.

We know flyers aren’t the best for the environment, which is why we don’t want you leafletting everywhere in sight. Instead, think community hubs, cafés, village halls, libraries, and other spots where people come together.

If you’re interested, just fill out the form below and we’ll get the flyers out to you!""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6878db70cb9160db05f23ff5;
                            :activityTitle "Handing out flyers";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:6894894774278e326abad9d5 :activityDescription """We host quarterly volunteering calls where anyone interested in getting involved can register their interest and get stuck in!

Whatever your background, skills, or prior knowledge – we’d love to have you on board.

Just fill in the form below and we’ll send you some information about joining the call.

https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdCNv8l1-NpLpZ2V6zvAdiJOD9YmNfDsuyJshKHcoYmrx2M1g/viewform
""";
