                            :longitude "-0.1362672"^^xsd:double.
id:689c6ae91baf638052b091c7 :activityDescription """At Carer’s Support we are committed to creating an environment where you can make a difference. No Carer group will be the same and your role as Group Assistant will be varied and enjoyable. You will be working within your local community, where your time will be used to help those in need of a helping hand.
You will have the opportunity to join Volunteer events, connecting with others, making new relationships and work with a team of empathetic and understanding individuals.
Carer Groups
A group is a collective with common goals or similar concerns. The purpose of a carer group is to offer members the opportunity to connect with others in a similar caring situation. Being part of a carer group can help individuals to gain support and know that they are not alone.
Role Expectations:
The Assistant will join and support the facilitation of the group alongside the Facilitator, ensuring a warm welcome to those that wish to join us. We want to create a safe environment for people to be able to talk about their caring roles when they feel comfortable to do so.
The Assistant will achieve this by actively listening and responding to issues and concerns raised by the carer if able to do so.
They will feedback to the Facilitator after the group, including any concerns for the carer or further action required.

Skills and Qualities Needed:
• Basic IT skills to be able to join online meetings and undertake online training.
• Active listening, and excellent & effective communication.
•Confident to engage with others within a face to face and virtual group setting.
•An insight into issues carers face on a daily basis.
•An empathetic caring approach when engaging with others.
•To be non-judgemental and be able to maintain personal boundaries.
•Encourage and promote carer health and wellbeing.
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:68930c2c566fafd42b4b55f7;
                            :activityTitle "Carer Groups Volunteer Group Assistant | Worthing & Lancing ";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
