id:68a4503dd1dda0d83652d805 :activityDescription "Battersea Parkrun is a free, fun, and friendly community 5k event, where participants can run, jog or walk to the finish line. Battersea Parkrun will see a Macmillan Takeover on the 27th September 2025 to increase awareness of Macmillan's services and celebrate 35 years of Coffee Morning! You can be a part of this by joining our friendly cheerpoint and making some noise for all of our fantastic supporters.";
