id:68a486e9865dd0a114b78c78 :activityDescription """Earth Trust looks after a range of green spaces across South Oxfordshire including seven community reserves in Abingdon, Wallingford, Crowmarsh and Didcot, Besselsleigh & Shrivenham.
Community Wardens are the eyes and ears of the Ranger team and keep them informed of any threats to public safety as well as keeping these special places clear of litter.
You could combine your regular walks with looking after a green space you care about.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425ed04c794380477b73fa1;
                            :activityTitle "Earth Trust Community Warden Volunteer";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
