id:68a4fbed25b0b2aae9b4b04b :activityDescription "We’d love for you to join our friendly team at the Bassuah Legacy Foundation shop! Every week we receive generous donations of clothes, books, and household items, and we need helping hands to sort through them. By giving a few hours of your time, you’ll be making sure these items quickly find their way to families who need them most, or help raise funds for our community projects. It’s a great way to meet new people, be part of something positive, and know that your time is making a real difference in the lives of others.";
