id:68a5ba4ac43e97b15a891103 :activityDescription """If you are passionate about spreading awareness of mental health issues and enjoy a role with autonomy and purpose this could be the volunteering role you are looking for!

We are looking for a self-starter with great admin skills to assist our Mental Health Trainer in collating a database of suitable training venues, assisting with bookings and organising venues, and helping with the preparation of training slides.

For a full role description and details of how to apply please visit https://www.mentalhealthresource.org.uk/general-volunteer-roles""";
