id:68a6042cfe7ace554e5f6bad :activityDescription """We are seeking experienced and motivated Assistant Skate Coaches to support the delivery of high-quality roller sports
sessions across our venues and programmes. This role is ideal for confident skaters with coaching experience,
particularly those who have worked with children and young people.
You will assist Lead Coaches in delivering engaging sessions across various skating disciplines and play a key role in
fostering a safe, inclusive, and positive environment for all participants.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641afb7afdca9c972649728a;
