id:68a60562a95264e50c9a2c8c :activityDescription """We are looking for enthusiastic and motivated individuals to join our coaching team as Trainee Roller Sports Coaches.
This role is ideal for those with a passion for sport, working with young people, and developing their coaching skills
within a supportive environment.

The Trainee Coach will assist in the delivery of structured roller sports sessions across multiple venues in the UK, with a
focus on after-school clubs and community programmes. Successful candidates will receive mentoring, ongoing training,
and the opportunity to gain practical coaching experience.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641afb7afdca9c972649728a;
                            :activityTitle "Trainee Roller Sports Coach";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:68a60562a95264e50c9a2c8d :address "Highgate Rd, London NW5 1RL, UK";
