id:68adc1e4b2dd21a1bfc2fa56 :activityDescription """Do you have a special talent you can share with our clients for an hour once or twice a month?

We are looking for entertainers of all kinds: Musicians, singers, storytellers, dancers, those able to hold an exercise or reminiscence group, animal or music therapy session, lead a quiz, game, discussion or other activity?


Open to all suggestions!""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64106006814bf5829d62a68e;
                            :activityTitle "Volunteer Entertainers";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:68adc6317c4bb0b32cc7bd84 :address "Hospital Bridge Road, Whitton, Twickenham TW2 6DE";
