id:68aeed8c19960c686f9e0528 :activityDescription """Access All Areas is looking for volunteers to support both its Performance Making Diploma and Take Part programmes!

Are you:
•An artist trying to perfect your craft?
•A student looking for a placement in participatory arts?
•Or… simply interested in getting involved in your community and in knowing more about performance making and/or access?

Our volunteering opportunities might be the right fit for you!

Join as a volunteer on our Take Part programmes and Diploma and…
 • Gain experience working within an established production company’s methodology
 • Get to be creative, inspiring and bold with your ideas
 • Be part of an inclusive performance-making process
 • Build your toolkit and learn the ropes of what it takes to do inclusive creative work
 • Work with emerging learning disabled and autistic artists

Performance Making Diploma overview
Run in partnership with the Royal Central School of Speech and Drama, our Performance Making Diploma is known as one of the world’s leading courses for and by learning disabled and autistic creatives. Students work with celebrated theatre and TV professionals to learn performance skills, create scripts and performances, and prepare for different career options in the arts and media.

Take Part Programmes overview 
Our Take Part programme works with participants across East London and beyond, building creative skills, increasing confidence and making performance. They take place in arts venues, day centres, care homes, community centres and colleges.

As a volunteer, you might…
 • Work creatively alongside students and participants and act as a ‘creative partner’ to support their ideas;
Provide access support for students and participants including note-taking, accessing sensory tool, repeating instructions, etc.;
 • Support the devising of performances;
 • Perform alongside participants as on-stage creative support or in forum theatre workshop exercises;
 • Attend theatre trips with students and participants.

For all the info: 
Visit our website www.accessallareasproductions.org
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:68aed66e9b30a48d069714ab;
                            :activityTitle "Volunteer with Access All Areas' Take Part and Diploma Programmes – Support Learning Disabled and autistic creatives";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:68aeed8c19960c686f9e0529 :address "Sutton House, 2-4 Homerton High St, London E9 6JQ, UK";
                            :latitude "51.5483614"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "-0.0503837"^^xsd:double.
