id:68b5c0d113b6c2a2813fc8ce :activityDescription """River Ivel Community Energy and Greensand Community Energy are looking for someone to join our teams of volunteers to head up the financial management of our organisations.
Ideally you will live in Central Bedfordshire but the roles can be done remotely.
One person covering both or 2 people would be fine.""";
