                            :longitude "-1.1827472"^^xsd:double.
id:68b80b6a0dd3fc0844dce34f :activityDescription """Want to get to know your local community? Look no further for a fun way to make a difference in your community!

Join FoodCycle as a Hosting Volunteer and help serve free, three-course meals for your local community!

You’ll get involved in everything from helping creating a warm, welcoming environment, serve meals, encouraging conversation and cleaning up. No experience? No problem! Our friendly FoodCycle Leaders will guide you through the session, making sure everything runs smoothly.

Why volunteer with FoodCycle?
- Make an impact – Help provide free, nutritious meals for those who need them.
- Meet great people – Be part of a welcoming, supportive team and connect with your local community.
- Flexible volunteering – No minimum commitment, just join when you can! Each cooking session lasts around four hours.

About FoodCycle:
FoodCycle is a national charity running community meals every week in multiple locations across England and Wales. We use food that would otherwise go to waste to create free, nutritious meals for anyone who needs them. But it’s more than just a meal—it’s a chance to chat, make friends, and feel part of your community.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:65d604686123f8876966688d;
                            :activityTitle "FoodCycle Hosting Volunteer - help us serve community meals (London)";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:68b80b6a0dd3fc0844dce350 :address "Merchant St, London E3 4LY, UK";
                            :latitude "51.5260619"^^xsd:double;
