id:68b99a2fc754f3f1e0c3edfa :activityDescription """We’re looking for help to design energy advice leaflets that we can use to support our energy advice service.

We’d love someone with graphic design skills to create a clear, visual A5 leaflet that explains what our service offers, why people should get in touch, and how they can contact us.

Experience in Canva is essential, as this is our primary design tool where all of our branded assets are hosted.

If you’re interested, let us know – we’ll support you throughout the process!""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:683d78ea21248b2c9fee5838;
                            :activityTitle "Help us design energy advice leaflets";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:68b99eb85c4af7af3ac80913 :activityDescription "We are looking for people to help with our lunch club plus. It Runs 9:30-14:30 and includes morning and afternoon refreshments and activities as well as lunch. The aim is to provide fun meaningful activities to encourage older people to socialize, make new friends and enjoy being with others. You would be helping facilitate the activities, serving refreshments and the meals and helping those attend enjoy their time with us. ";
                            :activityOrganisation id:65d5fc7c1db001584ab38d70;
                            :activityTitle "Lunch Club Helper";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:68b99fc85c4af7af3ac80a7e :activityDescription """We have some financial modelling in place within our group; however, we know it’s not perfect, and we’re looking for someone with experience to help us refine our process and review our current model.

This specific role within our organisation is only eligible for individuals with a background in finance and experience in financial modelling and Excel.

If you’re interested or would like to learn more about what this will involve, we’d love to hear from you!""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:683d78ea21248b2c9fee5838;
                            :activityTitle "Help us improve our financial modelling ";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:68b9a0e9f207ddd5d9ae091e :activityDescription """We’re looking to move away from our current website provider (Wix) as soon as possible. To help with this, we’d like someone to research a suitable platform that we can migrate to.

We’d like you to produce a summary of 2–3 platforms, including details such as costs and timelines for migration.

If you have experience in web development, this opportunity could expand into a broader role where you oversee the entire migration. If not, we’re simply looking for a motivated and committed volunteer to help us out.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:683d78ea21248b2c9fee5838;
                            :activityTitle "Help us begin our website migration";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:68b9a261e9e4ab92c8ed9543 :activityDescription """We’re looking for someone to help us research social housing providers that we can contact to better support social housing tenants (who are currently out of scope for Croydon Healthy Homes’ advice service).

No previous experience or skills necessary...we just want someone willing to do the online research.

We've put the target hours down as 1 hour, but really it's up to you and your capacity.

If you’re interested, we’d love to hear from you!""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:683d78ea21248b2c9fee5838;
                            :activityTitle "Help us to identify social housing providers in Croydon";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:68b9a3a35c4af7af3ac80dc9 :activityDescription """We’re looking for someone to review our Energy Advice page on our website to make sure all the information is up to date.

The role involves checking that all links are current and carrying out some research to help us find useful links, articles, or other resources to signpost people to.

We’d love someone who’s happy to put in the time to help us find some fantastic resources – and if you already have experience in this area, that would be amazing too!

Our enery advice page -> https://www.croydoncommunityenergy.co.uk/energy-advice""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:683d78ea21248b2c9fee5838;
                            :activityTitle "Help us to update our Energy Advice website page";
