id:68c03f857b8ae4ae48208028 :activityDescription """Join our small team of paid staff and volunteers and be part of welcoming and serving customers to the Café within The Oxfordshire Museum.

The café is a comfortable, friendly space where our museum visitors and members of the community come to relax and enjoy a drink or something to eat.
Tasks would include:
- Providing good customer service for visitors to the café.
- Promoting and encouraging sales in the café.
- Support staff with maintaining health and hygiene within the café, helping keep cafe clean and tidy and using dishwasher.
- Following training, making hot drinks, and taking payments from customers.
- Promoting the museum, its collections and services.

Volunteers are provided with Barista and till training. Aprons are provided. Volunteers benefit from 10% discount in the cafe and museum shop.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425f499f2d4b77a6e156f51;
                            :activityTitle "Oxfordshire Museum Cafe Volunteers";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
