id:68c175e2b5329601fab48b72 :cause id:64093b552eed5dcadba5089f;
                            :organisationDescription "BuildaSkill CIC is a social enterprise based in Central Bedfordshire, delivering practical, mobile workshop programmes to young people who are disengaged from or at risk of exclusion from education. Using a fully equipped workshop van, we provide 12- and 24-week programmes, community projects, and site visits, combining carpentry, DIY, and construction skills with mentoring and personal development. Our purpose is to help young people build confidence, improve social behaviours, and develop the employability skills they need to move into education, training, or work. ";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/1e27cbf1-be38-4511-b0a5-98083ea1df7c_2025-09-10T12:58:09.200Z.jpeg>;
                            :organisationName "Build a Skill CIC".
id:68c17ac75f5b157d06f000aa :activityOrganisation id:67aa00bb8e0715d8c0eefd61;
