id:68c23b7b60e1a0cf3587e2ff :activityDescription """**Opportunity:** Room Hire Administrator 
**Reporting to: **Site Manager 
Availability needed from Tuesday to Sunday, minimum commitment of 2 days a week.  
 
We are looking for a Room Hire Administrator to join our admin support team at RSPB Sandwell Valley. This role will be responsible for all room hire enquiries at the reserve. We want everyone who hires a room with us to have an enjoyable experience from start to finish – and that’s where you come in. We need someone who is organised, friendly, and who has a positive attitude, to ensure a smooth operation for all room hire enquiries. 

We would like a minimum commitment of 2 days per week; you can work from our office on site or based at home. However, proximity to the reserve is key as you will be required to work on-site one day per month. This role can be worked from Tuesday to Sunday, and we're looking to start around as soon as possible. We are happy to consider any flexible requests upon application.  

**Key tasks include**

Liaising with prospective customers on the room hire provision we offer at RSPB Sandwell Valley 

Working with the site team on all bookings 

Creating brochures, as well as other marketing material to promote our room hire provision 

Supporting with development of room hire offers, allowing us to improve our current offering 

Communicating with the Events Team to ensure that all room hire offers are compliant with head office updates 

Reviewing contracts with support from regional teams 

**Skills needed**

Be a good all round 'people person'  

Have a keen attention to detail and great organisational skills  

Be a confident user of Microsoft Word, Outlook and Excel  

Happy/comfortable volunteering remotely, from your own home, as well as on site  

Good written communication skills  

Reliable & committed 

If you would like to apply for this role, please fill out our application form my clicking “Apply Now”. For any further questions relating to this role, please click on the enquiry button to get in touch. 

We look forward to receiving your application! 

**Please be aware the role profile below is a general one, the description above is more specific**""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64119bf12a79fbd15e8912b6;
                            :activityTitle "Administrator (Room Hire Admin @ RSPB Sandwell Valley)";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation true.
id:68c23b7b60e1a0cf3587e300 :address "Sandwell Valley, Tanhouse Avenue, Birmingham, West Midlands, B43 5AG, England";
