                            :longitude "0.018938"^^xsd:double.
id:68c62ffb7b16865081c272e3 :activityDescription """We are looking for volunteers who can help lead our events here at Frampton Marsh and Freiston Shore. Specifically we are looking for someone with a knowledge of moths to co-lead our Bat and Moth Evenings, running between May and September. Potentially they could also lead the running of Moth Mornings, over the same period.

As the co-lead you will responsible for: 
Managing the list of pre-booked event participants, and potentially taking money from any walk-ups. 
Providing an enjoyable and inspirational experience to all participants. 
Running the event in a safe manner

Full training and support will be provide for this role but you do need to be a ‘people person’ and have good communication skills. You will also need reasonable knowledge of moths, and how to use moth traps.""";
