                            :organisationDescription """We’re a woman led, all women charity who are LGBTQ+ friendly and welcome volunteers to help this movement! 
There’s a huge gap in Leeds and the UK in regards to BAME victims and victims with pets and that’s where we bridge the gap with pet and BAME specialists. """;
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/e74fe2b0-d399-40a2-9a87-7483eb87cd51_2025-09-14T11:22:10.641Z.jpeg>;
                            :organisationName "SafeHaven Companions ".
id:68c6afea5c73c6d90894f866 :activityDescription """SafeHaven Companions is a women-led charity supporting women and women with pets, with a specialist team from the BAME community, and this service is for people who have experienced sexual exploitation/abuse. 💜 We create a safe, supportive space where healing and empowerment come first.

What we do:
✨ All-women support groups
✨ Creative craft workshops
✨ Story-sharing and safe spaces for young adults
✨ Providing hygiene packs & pet essentials
✨ Designing and selling empowering merch to fund our work

We’re looking for kind, passionate volunteers who can offer ongoing support — whether that’s helping run workshops, packing hygiene or pet essentials, supporting events, or simply being a friendly face for our community.

This is a flexible, ongoing role — any time you can give will help us create a safe haven for women and their companions. 💖""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:68c6a56335eb320ad3553f70;
                            :activityTitle "SafeHaven Companions – Volunteer With Us!";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:68c6afea5c73c6d90894f867 :address "Leeds";
                            :latitude "53.8007554"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "-1.5490774"^^xsd:double.
id:68c7816133c32a8d53e79f3b :activityDescription """**We are looking for adult Work Party Volunteers to make the regular commitment to join us on our Lochwinnoch reserve every Friday from 9.30am until 4pm.**

RSPB nature reserves are special places for people and wildlife and we rely on volunteers to keeps these habitats thriving and in good shape.

**This role is suitable for over 18’s and best suited to volunteers who live nearby. Our volunteers live within a 25 mile radius of our Reserve.**

It might seem like these wild places have always just been there. But quite often we have to work really hard to maintain habitats to be in the best condition for wildlife. We have lost a lot of wild landscapes, so the small places that we do have, need a bit of extra care.

As a Reserve Work Party Volunteer you will be joining a regular practical work party team to undertake practical habitat management tasks such as:

- Cutting and clearing vegetation.
- Maintaining and managing tools and equipment.
- Creating and maintaining visitor infrastructure, such as paths and benches. -Work in our habitats to improve the environment for wildlife.
- Following annual work plans.
- Following Health and Safety protocols.

If you enjoy being outdoors, meeting new people and hands on conservation work, then this role could be the perfect opportunity for you. This role does involve a reasonable amount of physical activity, so will enable you to keep your fitness levels high, as well as helping your mental health and wellbeing. You will have the satisfaction of knowing that you are making a genuine contribution to nature conservation, and you might find it rewarding to safeguard nature in the area you are working to protect.

We are a friendly and supportive team. If you are volunteering to learn new skills and gain knowledge about wildlife conservation work, you will find that our team will be more than happy to help you on that journey.

Please disregard the additional information, below, which states that this role is suitable for under 18s. Applicants must be over 18.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64119bf12a79fbd15e8912b6;
                            :activityTitle "Practical Reserve Work (Work Party Volunteer)";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation true.
id:68c7816133c32a8d53e79f3c :address "Lochwinnoch, Largs Road, Lochwinnoch, Renfrewshire, PA12 4JF, Scotland";
