id:68c840bc141138a301000174 :activityDescription """About BuildaSkill CIC
BuildaSkill CIC is a new social enterprise based in Central Bedfordshire. We operate a mobile workshop that delivers hands-on skills training and mentoring to young people who are disengaged from, or at risk of exclusion from, education. Our programmes combine carpentry, DIY, decorating, gardening, and employability training with mentoring, industry visits, and community projects.

The Role
We are seeking volunteer Directors to join our Board and support the growth and governance of BuildaSkill CIC. Directors will work alongside the Founder to provide oversight, set strategy, and ensure that we meet our objectives as a Community Interest Company.

Key Duties

Attend 4–6 Board meetings per year (approx. 2–4 hours a month).

Provide strategic input into the development of our programmes.

Ensure compliance with CIC and safeguarding regulations.

Act as an ambassador for BuildaSkill CIC within the community.

Contribute skills in areas such as education, youth work, finance, safeguarding, business development, or community engagement.

Impact
As a Director you will play a vital role in shaping a new organisation that supports young people to build skills, confidence, and pathways into education, training, or employment. Your involvement will help reduce school exclusions, improve life chances, and strengthen community outcomes.

Who we’re looking for
We welcome applications from people with:

A commitment to supporting young people and communities.

Experience in one or more of the following: education, safeguarding, finance, trades, business, governance, fundraising, or youth services.

Good communication and teamwork skills.

Integrity and willingness to uphold safeguarding and governance responsibilities.

What you’ll gain

The opportunity to make a real difference in the lives of young people.

Experience in social enterprise governance and community leadership.

The chance to use your expertise to help shape a growing organisation.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:68c175e2b5329601fab48b72;
                            :activityTitle "Volunteer Director – BuildaSkill CIC";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:68c840bc141138a301000175 :address "From Home";
