id:68c8d2e90bfb9ff45e490ab9 :activityDescription """Are you keen to help save nature, would like to utilise your existing office-based skills and have up to 1 day a week to spare? 

We are looking for volunteers who can support teams and take on administrator tasks as part of an existing team that supports the RSPB operation. By opening up our work to more volunteers in this way, it means we can scale up what we can achieve and do more for nature. 

You will be a good all round 'people person', have a keen attention to detail and great organisational skills as well as a confident user of Microsoft Word, Outlook and Excel.  

This is a great opportunity to utilise your existing skills and learn new ones, whilst working as part of a small, friendly team. There is room for development within the role, an opportunity to volunteer for additional days or role-share.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:64119bf12a79fbd15e8912b6;
                            :activityTitle "Administrator (Legal Adminstrator)";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation true.
