id:68cabbc30c27d58826a06545 :cause id:64093b552eed5dcadba5089f;
                            :organisationDescription """CCS Adoption is a Voluntary Adoption Agency and a Children’s Charity. We find permanent, loving families for children who need them when they can no longer safely live with their birth family. CCS Adoption started in 1904 and strives to provide the highest quality support to adoptees and their adoptive parents.

CCS Adoption is particularly proud of our “Outstanding” rating from Ofsted, evidencing the quality of our work and the passion the staff has for supporting our families. 

CCS families benefit from our unique therapeutic team and a wide range of activities and social events through our Adoption Support Services. We promise and deliver to our families lifelong support. Our dedicated team of experienced Social Workers and Family Support Workers have worked with families over the years on lots of issues – transition to secondary school, life story work, meeting up with birth family etc.""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/2e0b6e93-397a-4fea-8d42-3c8ad6fd99c3_2025-09-17T13:50:09.283Z.jpeg>;
                            :organisationName "CCS Adoption";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://www.ccsadoption.org/>.
id:68cad2dab0613cb4c48a682c :activityDescription "CCS Adoption is seeking a dynamic and committed Chair of Trustees to lead our Board and help us drive our ambitions forward.  As Chair of Trustees, you will play a pivotal role in guiding the strategic direction of CCS Adoption, ensuring we remain financially stable, legally compliant, and true to our mission. You’ll work closely with the CEO and lead board meetings, monitor performance, and act as a key ambassador for the organisation.";
                            :activityOrganisation id:68cabbc30c27d58826a06545;
                            :activityTitle "Chair of Trustees";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
id:68cad2dab0613cb4c48a682d :address "Daventry Road, Bristol BS4 1DQ";
