id:68cbf07cf2ba1c0aeb1c07e4 :activityDescription """Get into the festive spirit by volunteering at X Factor's G4’s Christmas Concert. Hear wonderful renditions of Christmas classics, even join in on a few tunes yourself, all while supporting the charity Missing People. This is a fantastic opportunity to volunteer at a truly enjoyable evening so don’t miss out.

