id:68cd1f68ff521a42f2dd642c :cause id:64093b542eed5dcadba50897;
                            :organisationDescription "We act as a vital bridge between underserved communities and essential public services such as the NHS, West Midlands Police, Mental Health support providers, and local authorities. Many members of our community face challenges in accessing these services due to language barriers, cultural differences, or lack of representation. Harmony Nexus Hub CIC is here to help fill that gap through outreach, education, and collaboration.";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/40ac9fac-cb62-4fc2-bf65-02a1b81b7e9a_2025-09-19T09:16:22.381Z.jpeg>;
                            :organisationName "Harmony Nexus Hub CIC";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://sites.google.com/view/harmonynexushub/home?authuser=1>.
id:68cd20355f9c364cafc0d2ba :activityDescription """Are you passionate about community work and looking to gain valuable experience in administration, events, and social media? Join us at HARMONY NEXUS HUB CIC, where we’re making a real difference in people’s lives every day.

Role: Volunteer Community Administrator
Location: Birmingham B10 0NR
Hours: Flexible (we can work around your availability)

What you’ll be doing:

Assisting the Director with the day-to-day running of the centre

Responding to emails and enquiries

Registering new service users and keeping records up to date

Supporting with planning and delivering community events

Helping manage and grow our social media presence

What we’re looking for:

Friendly, reliable, and organised

Good communication and basic IT skills

Enthusiasm for supporting the local community

Willingness to learn and take on new challenges

What you’ll gain:

Hands-on experience in administration, events, and community engagement

The opportunity to develop new skills and build your CV

A supportive and welcoming team environment

Potential to progress into a paid role within the organisation

If you’re looking for a meaningful volunteering opportunity with the chance to grow into paid work, we’d love to hear from you!

📩 To apply or find out more, please email: ayan@harmonynexushub.com
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:68cd1f68ff521a42f2dd642c;
                            :activityTitle "🌟 Volunteer Community Administrator Wanted 🌟";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
