id:68d29d3fee975bd5c6e4a532 :activityDescription """Our community club, based in NN3, is on the lookout for new coaches.

As we try to increase the number of teams at the club and build a full pathway, we want to add a U8 or U9 team starting this season, a U18 & Men’s team for next season, and a girls team. 

No previous experience necessary, just an enthusiastic attitude. The club will fund the required courses and contribute to further coaching development. 

If you are looking to take your first step into coaching or have a child interested in joining a football team and considering setting up your own, please take the first step and get in touch. """;
                            :activityOrganisation id:68d29b2aa5ad8bb68225c4d3;
