id:68d54cecdae4f2bdae4ddc3f :address "Newmarket Rd, Cambridge, UK";
                            :latitude "52.2123522"^^xsd:double;
                            :longitude "0.1617591"^^xsd:double.
id:68d5503de153b4a8598d063a :activityDescription """We are a brand new charity set up to save the deconsecrated church of St Andrew the Less on Newmarket Road in Cambridge.  We are all volunteers, and are lacking experience in book keeping.  We really need someone who will be able to  support with book-keeping and fund accounting. We are seeking an individual knowledgeable in charity accounting who can support with creating year end accruals accounts.   You will be:
•	Maintaining accurate and up-to-date financial records.
•	Recording income and expenditure in line with charity finance regulations.
•	Reconciling bank statements and financial transactions.
•	Assisting with the preparation of financial reports for trustees and stakeholders.
•	Ensuring compliance with relevant financial policies and procedures.
•	Liaising with the Treasurer and other relevant members of the nonprofit regarding financial matters where necessary. 
At first duties will be light, but hopefully when we start winning grants, there will be more work.
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:68d5487e087a45d0b6902fea;
                            :activityTitle "Volunteer Book Keeper";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
