                            :organisationDescription """We are a local group supporting community solar installations, and running events to help people with energy savings and warmer homes.

We are currently setting up a new website and newsletter, and we are looking to increase our community engagement.""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/8b6bfc2f-b446-48c1-9b95-e6479c3ce88c_2025-09-25T14:29:34.350Z.jpeg>;
