id:68d554bb6c23bcb168754f45 :activityDescription """ROLE NOW FILLED

We are looking for a creative volunteer! ✨ 

Forest Community Energy is re-branding this autumn and we are looking for someone to help bring our new look to life.

We are especially keen to find support with:

Social media (Facebook, Youtube, LinkedIn)
Design / Branding (Canva)
Website/newsletter content editing (Ghost)

If you have expereince in any of these areas we would love to hear from you. The role is flexible around your skills and we can provide training in social media/design.

Use your skills for good, support a community energy group, and join our friendly, motivated team.
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:68d551cf33065699d2efeba1;
