id:68da5fd89445ad1cf9c2c0b8 :activityDescription """As an Office Volunteer at Prostate Cancer UK, you'll play a key role in helping us to achieve our mission: ensuring that no man dies of prostate cancer. You'll provide support on a variety of non-time-sensitive tasks, helping the Volunteer Experience Team to work more efficiently and effectively so we can make an even bigger difference. 

In return, you'll be welcomed into a friendly, collaborative environment as a valued member of the team. You'll have opportunities to build your skills and gain hands-on experience, deepening your understanding of the charity sector and seeing first-hand how your efforts support life-changing work. For further details, please see the Role Description. 

We ask for a time commitment of around two days per month in-person, depending on your availability. After you’ve settled in, some working from home may be available. 

To apply, please complete the Application Form before 6PM on Friday 17th October. If shortlisted, you'll be invited for an informal chat the following week, either in-person or online to suit your needs. """;
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425cf6ca0624f3ab9fb3dd6;
                            :activityTitle "Office Volunteer - Volunteer Experience Team";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
