id:68dd059222974b6aebc7bbe4 :activityDescription """We’re recruiting event volunteers for our upcoming Autumn Adventures: Tales & Trails! Help us to create something special and make the event unforgettable. We’re looking for friendly faces to join us in roles including:
✨ Car parking
✨ Admissions
✨ Crafts & children’s activities
✨ Maize maze keeping
✨ Trail maintenance
Why volunteer?
🌿Be a part of creating a magical, nature-inspired day for families
🌿Meet new people and enjoy the fresh air
🌿Build your event / nature-education experience
🌿Support your local community and environment
📅 Dates: Sat 18 & Sun 19 October plus Sat 25 – Fri 31 (half-term)
📍 Location: Earth Trust Farm, OX14 4QZ""";
