Position Overview: We are seeking a dedicated HR Business Partner to join our team on a voluntary basis. As we enhance our Professional Development Programme, this role will focus on internal HR functions and partnerships:

Promote different arts, sports and cultures to encourage an intercultural understanding between different communities and societies
