                            :longitude "-0.3766513"^^xsd:double.
id:68e7895073bc9d1daed52d83 :activityDescription """As a  Friends of Moorfields shop volunteer you will be on hand to support our shop team and staff to price goods, serve customers and answer queries. We are also looking for volunteers to operate our mobile shop (trolley service) to patients and staff around the hospital.

Volunteering with us will give you a great sense of purpose and transferable skills and experience that can be used for job/university applications amongst other things. 
""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425f94df2d4b77a6e15e679;
                            :activityTitle "Shop Volunteers - Friends of Moorfields ";
