id:68e78f05bebfd220e4aec1f2 :activityDescription """As a Friends of Moorfields volunteer, you'll be at the front-line of providing emotional and physical support to patients with visual impairment and to ensure Moorfields provide an excellent service. 

As a phone support volunteer you'll be responsible for making friendly phone calls to our patients to remind them of their appointments, and to encourage them to attend. You will also trouble-shoot any issues that patients may have, listen to their concerns and note down any issues they may have to be raised with the booking centre. 

Volunteering with us will give you a great sense of purpose and transferable skills that can be used for job/university applications amongst other things. """;
                            :activityOrganisation id:6425f94df2d4b77a6e15e679;
                            :activityTitle "Phone Support - Friends of Moorfields ";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
