                            :organisationDescription """We are a volunteer led, not-for-profit organisation serving the local community at the heart of the community.
We have a community cafe, a charity shop and offer classes.
We offer courses and workshops free of charge to the local community.
We also offer a 12 week counselling placement for those in need.""";
