id:68ee48e575694291b0de8884 :activityDescription """Lewisham Refugee and Migrant Network (LRMN) is looking for volunteers with a range of skills and interests to support our weekly women's group - from creative activities to wellbeing sessions and practical support. 

Our women's group meets every Wednesday, 10:30am-12:00pm, South East London. The group provides a safe, welcoming space for refugee, migrant, and local women to connect, relax, and build confidence. Volunteers help make this sessions enriching and supporting. 

We are especially interested in volunteers with experience or interest in areas such as:
Fitness and Zumba
Mindfulness and relaxation
Financial literacy
Wellbeing workshop facilitation
Storytelling or creative writing

This is an open call, and we would love to hear from anyone who can offer something meaningful, whether it's a one-off session or a recurring activity. """;
                            :activityOrganisation id:68ee43a0bbd2e04d738c67d4;
                            :activityTitle "Volunteer Facilitators for Women's Group Activity (Wednesdays 10:30-12:00)";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
