id:68ee586ab2b5b5f7c0d5753d :activityDescription """Sign up for a Volunteering Champion Pack and help grow our volunteering community to support more people with sight loss.

Volunteers are essential to the services that Guide Dogs provide. Recruiting volunteers will mean we can help more people with sight loss. With a Volunteering Champion Pack, you can promote volunteering as and when it suits you. 

There is no one better to help us with the challenge of finding more volunteers than you – a local area expert with knowledge about your community that could help us find volunteers in areas where people with sight loss need our services the most.

Request a Volunteering Champion pack to receive a bundle of promotional materials such as our posters, leaflets and business cards.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:67fd18897dad02c4a73fb3b9;
                            :activityTitle "Volunteering Champion Pack";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation true.
id:68ee5bbe5b23848308dc5442 :activityDescription """Join the Walsall FC Match Day Takeover – An evening of Fun, Football & Making a Difference! 

Monday 29th December:  
Walsall vs Oldham
Kick off 7.45pm
Want to be part of the action and make a meaningful impact? Volunteer at our Acorns Match Day Takeover

Volunteer time: Around 5.30pm - head to the Acorns Gazebo on the main car park/Fan Zone to sign in
The bucket collection will finish no later than 10pm.
Location: Along the event route
What's Involved?

You'll be an essential part of our charity fundraising bucket-collecting crew, taking donations before, during, and after the match – and even in the exclusive hospitality areas!
Free match tickets – Cheer on the teams, while supporting a great cause!
Limited on-site parking is available.
 
Am I Right For the Role?

We’re looking for volunteers who are:

Friendly & Approachable – ready to share the mission of Acorns
Confident to collect donations outside – rain or shine!
Why Volunteer with Acorns?

Make a real difference in your local community
Gain valuable experience and boost your CV
Be part of something special with the chance to progress into other roles

Ready to get involved? Email us at volunteer@acorns.org.uk to find out more or apply below""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:641096af1097b43af15de362;
                            :activityTitle "Volunteer Walsall FC Takeover - 29th December";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
