id:68f0da2ff831c4e5dbb43f93 :cause id:64093b552eed5dcadba508a3;
                            :organisationDescription """CEL empowers London’s community energy sector by:
- Advocating for community energy with the GLA, boroughs, and policymakers.
- Providing technical advice, training, and funding access to local groups.
- Building partnerships across the public, private, and voluntary sectors.
- Supporting governance, operations, and data systems to scale impact.
- Delivering strategic initiatives to grow sector investment and visibility.
- Supporting new groups and expanding presence into underrepresented boroughs.
- Creating platforms for collaboration, learning, and shared success among groups.

Through these activities, CEL turns grassroots energy ambition into practical, lasting change — helping London achieve its climate goals while delivering community resilience, inclusion, and economic opportunity.""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/8408c941-a7d5-484a-a2b0-3b193c164464_2025-10-16T11:42:39.323Z.jpeg>;
                            :organisationName "Community Energy London";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://www.communityenergy.london/>.
