                                   id:64093b552eed5dcadba508a1;
                            :organisationDescription """Murphy Charitable Foundation Uganda, established in 2018, is a registered humanitarian nonprofit organization based in Bukedea, Eastern Uganda. Its mission is to uplift marginalized rural communities by focusing on the needs of vulnerable children, youth, and women. The foundation is committed to providing equal access to education, healthcare, clean water, and livelihood opportunities to break the cycle of poverty. Its goal is to empower and enhance the lives of these individuals, believing that everyone deserves a chance to succeed.

Guided by Christian values, the foundation strives to implement effective and innovative solutions to pressing community issues. It operates at the grassroots level, planning and executing projects that address local challenges and promote sustainable development. Through collaboration with volunteers, donors, and community partners, the foundation aims to create lasting positive change in Uganda's most vulnerable populations.
""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/d5045797-6880-4c1b-b253-490b6e6d66e3_2025-10-19T13:12:16.215Z.jpeg>;
                            :organisationName "Murphy charitable foundation Uganda ";
                            :organisationWebsite <https://www.murphycharity.org/>.
id:68f4f6d575567fd1f1bee8c1 :activityDescription """In many African communities, poverty and tradition force children into adult roles far too soon, becoming parents, spouses, or laborers as early as age 12. Education is often cut short, and support is limited.

That’s why we created the Pen Pal Program , a simple yet powerful way for caring individuals like you to uplift these children with letters of hope, encouragement, and guidance. Just 20–30 minutes a week or month can make a lasting difference.

Your letters can touch on education, health, culture, the environment, or simply send warm wishes for important moments like exams, birthdays, Christmas, or Eid.

We’ll carefully match you with a child based on your availability and interests, along with their age, gender, dream job, favorite color, pets, and hobbies. Right now, more than 5,000 children are waiting to connect.

Whether you’re a student, parent, retiree, or part of a group, your words can inspire a brighter future.

Be the reason a child keeps believing. Join us today.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:68f4e3bffe3f8f55aef0e544;
                            :activityTitle "Write a Pen Pal letter to an African Child in Need!";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
