id:68f53f8346b712131f0148e7 :cause id:64093b552eed5dcadba5089f;
                            :organisationDescription """Beyond Theory is a youth-led, nonprofit initiative dedicated to providing free academic mentorship and personal development opportunities for students aged 11–16, particularly those from underrepresented or disadvantaged backgrounds.

Our programme connects students with passionate volunteer mentors who offer one-on-one and group sessions to improve academic confidence, develop study skills, and inspire future aspirations.

Beyond Theory’s mission is to bridge educational gaps and empower young people to reach their full potential, regardless of their circumstances. We collaborate with schools, charities, and community organisations to expand access to quality learning support and create lasting impact across the world.

We operate online via Zoom to international students and UK students.""";
                            :organisationImage <https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/doit2.0-production-uploads/OrganizationPicture/b4d8ffb0-97fb-41cf-9346-8956abfb8e2e_2025-10-19T19:44:02.936Z.jpeg>;
                            :organisationName "Beyond Theory ".
id:68f5406090268edd4a86435a :activityDescription """Beyond Theory is a youth-led, nonprofit initiative dedicated to providing free academic mentorship and personal development opportunities for students aged 11–16, particularly those from underrepresented or disadvantaged backgrounds.

Our programme connects students with passionate volunteer mentors who offer one-on-one and group sessions to improve academic confidence, develop study skills, and inspire future aspirations.

Beyond Theory’s mission is to bridge educational gaps and empower young people to reach their full potential, regardless of their circumstances. We collaborate with schools, charities, and community organisations to expand access to quality learning support and create lasting impact across the world.

We are looking for people to promote our organisation through outreach with local groups, schools and other organisations and social media. This is a volunteer opportunity and you will not be compensated, however certificates of completion and volunteer hours will be given. Please note, anyone under 16 can join as a mentee rather than a volunteer.""";
                            :activityOrganisation id:68f53f8346b712131f0148e7;
                            :activityTitle "Beyond Theory Learning : Long Term Volunteer Opportunities";
                            :allowsRemoteParticipation false.
